ddress_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Dupont, 67","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Lanc\u00e9e en 2001, Bruxelles fait son cin\u00e9ma est une activit\u00e9 de cin\u00e9ma itin\u00e9rant en plein air, issue d\u2019une vieille tradition venant des pays m\u00e9diterran\u00e9ens. Cette activit\u00e9, initi\u00e9e \u00e0 l'\u00e9poque sous l'impulsion du Ministre en charge de la culture \u00e0 la COCOF, s\u2019est rapidement dessin\u00e9e comme une continuit\u00e9 du partenariat de Lib\u00e9ration Films Animation avec le Festival Cin\u00e9ma M\u00e9diterran\u00e9en de Bruxelles (d\u2019o\u00f9 la programmation de films issus de pays m\u00e9diterran\u00e9ens).\r\n \r\nCes s\u00e9ances organis\u00e9es en plein air dans diff\u00e9rentes communes bruxelloises sont l\u2019occasion d\u2019animer la capitale et de faire d\u00e9couvrir sa richesse multiculturelle. \r\nQuand on sait que la cohabitation entre habitants d\u2019origines diverses se vit parfois difficilement, cette activit\u00e9 se veut un lieu de rencontre o\u00f9 l\u2019on tente, modestement, de favoriser une meilleure compr\u00e9hension de l\u2019autre.\r\n \r\nLes films propos\u00e9s ont pour objectif la d\u00e9couverte d\u2019un cin\u00e9ma de qualit\u00e9 par un public le plus large possible.. L\u2019activit\u00e9 permet \u00e9galement de revoir sur grand \u00e9cran certains films sortis parfois trop furtivement dans les salles.\r\n \r\nPour les personnes qui ne fr\u00e9quentent plus beaucoup les salles de cin\u00e9ma, c\u2019est l\u2019occasion de retrouver tout le plaisir que procure un film sur grand \u00e9cran, dans des quartiers d\u00e9sert\u00e9s par les salles de cin\u00e9ma, et qui plus est, dans un cadre inhabituel et une ambiance chaleureuse et conviviale. \r\n \r\nUne occasion de d\u00e9tente et de rencontre pour les habitants des communes bruxelloises qui n\u2019ont pas tous la chance de partir en vacances.\r\n ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Lib\u00e9ration Animations asbl","address_street_name":"Dupontstraat","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"liberationfilms@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.liberationfilms.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 48 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Dupontstraat, 67","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Lib\u00e9ration Animations asbl","address_street_name":"Rue Dupont","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"liberationfilms@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.liberationfilms.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 48 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Dupont, 67","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Lib\u00e9ration Animations asbl","address_street_name":"Rue Dupont","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"liberationfilms@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.liberationfilms.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 48 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Dupont, 67","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Lib\u00e9ration Animations asbl","address_street_name":"Rue Dupont","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"liberationfilms@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.liberationfilms.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 48 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Dupont, 67","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual