"Ni\u00f1os"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}},"tags":["major_event","exterior","kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,257,259,261,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Cane guida","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T03:05:52+02:00","published_at":"2023-06-13T15:48:33+02:00","backoffice_id":279330,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"festival","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.28219327709008},{"id":556078,"date_start":"2023-05-26","date_end":"2023-07-09","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,34],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Galeries","Pluridisciplinair"],"en":["Art Galleries","Multidisciplinary"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Multidisziplin\u00e4r"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Multidisciplinare"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Multidisciplinar"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014","shortdescr":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014 est une exposition explorant le concept de v\u00e9rit\u00e9 et la construction de la connaissance \u00e0 travers les relations entre art, technologie, science et soci\u00e9t\u00e9.","longdescr":"Rassemblant les \u0153uvres d'environ 18 artistes belges et internationaux, cette exposition emprunte son titre au po\u00e8me homonyme d\u2019Emily Dickinson, dans lequel la po\u00e9tesse nous invite \u00e0 \u00eatre radicalement honn\u00eates, mais \u00e0 dire la v\u00e9rit\u00e9 indirectement, de biais, afin de ne pas choquer ou submerger.\r\n\r\nTell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2013 soul\u00e8ve des questions vari\u00e9es et ouvertes : de la relation entre v\u00e9rit\u00e9 et connaissance, de l\u2019opposition entre certitude et doute, aux pi\u00e8ges du mensonge ; de l\u2019\u00e9criture de l\u2019histoire \u00e0 la complexit\u00e9 des syst\u00e8mes de croyance, en passant par le r\u00f4le de la conscience, de l\u2019esprit et du corps.\r\n\r\nOutre les \u0153uvres des artistes, des scientifiques, des philosophes, d\u2019\u00e9pist\u00e9mologues et d\u2019experts de diff\u00e9rents domaines ont \u00e9t\u00e9 invit\u00e9s \u00e0 contribuer \u00e0 l\u2019exposition, offrant au public des r\u00e9flexions, des points de vue et des consid\u00e9rations issus des perspectives les plus diverses de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 contemporaine.\r\nQu\u2019est-ce qui est vrai, comment le d\u00e9cide-t-on et par qui ? La science a-t-elle toujours raison ? \r\n\r\nArtistes\r\nSajjad Abbas (IQ) | Kim Albrecht (DE) | Mathilde Boussange (BE) | Philippe Braquenier (BE) | Peter de Cupere (BE) | Forensic Architecture (UK) | fuse* (IT) | Yannick Jacquet (FR\/CH), Laurent et Manuel Talbot (BE) | David OReilly (IE) | Matthias Pitscher (DE) | Bill Posters (UK) et Daniel Howe (US) | Margerita Pul\u00e8 (MT) et Elise Billiard-Pisani (FR) |  Yoan Robin (FR) | TOAST (AU) | Rose Tytgat (BE) | Gillian Wearing (UK). Avec la participation de la Maison de la Marionnette de Tournai (BE)\r\n \r\n\r\nScientifiques, chercheur\u00b7euse\u00b7s et expert\u00b7e\u00b7s\r\nAllon Bar |  Brenda Bikoko (VUB) | Maarten Boudry (UGent) | Henri Broch | Laura Calabrese (ULB) | Axel Cleeremans (ULB) | Thomas Durand | Elisabeth Feytit | Marius Gilbert (ULB) | Olivier Klein (ULB) | Eric Muraille (ULB) | C\u00e9line Rase (UNamur) | Olivier Sartenaer (UNamur) | Athanasia Symeonidou (Howest University) | Barbara Truffin (ULB) | Nathan Uyttendaele (UCL) | Jean-Paul Van Bendegem (VUB) | Bavo Van Kerrebroeck (McGill University)","performers":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014rassemble le travail de 18 artistes belges et internationaux, ainsi que la contribution de scientifiques, de chercheurs et d'experts de diff\u00e9rents domaines.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/studio-fr\/tell-all-the-truth-but-tell-is-slant-fr\/","email":"gwen@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556078"},"nl":{"name":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014","shortdescr":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant - is een tentoonstelling die het concept waarheid en de constructie van kennis onderzoekt via de relatie tussen kunst, technologie, wetenschap en maatschappij.","longdescr":"Deze tentoonstelling, die werken samenbrengt van een 18-tal Belgische en internationale kunstenaars, ontleent haar titel aan het gelijknamige gedicht van Emily Dickinson, waarin de dichteres ons uitnodigt radicaal eerlijk te zijn, maar de waarheid indirect, schuin te vertellen, om niet te choqueren of te overweldigen.\r\n\r\nKunstenaars\r\nSajjad Abbas (IQ) | Kim Albrecht (DE) | Mathilde Boussange (BE) | Philippe Braquenier (BE) | Peter de Cupere (BE) | Forensic Architecture (UK) | fuse* (IT) | Yannick Jacquet (FR\/CH), Laurent en Manuel Talbot (BE) | David OReilly (IE) | Matthias Pitscher (DE) | Bill Posters (UK) en Daniel Howe (US) | Margerita Pul\u00e8 (MT) en Elise Billiard-Pisani (FR) | Yoan Robin (FR) | TOAST (AU) | Rose Tytgat (BE) | Gillian Wearing (UK). Met medewerking van het Maison de la Marionnette de Tournai (BE)\r\n \r\n\r\nWetenschappers, onderzoekers en deskundigen\r\nAllon Bar | Brenda Bikoko (VUB) | Maarten Boudry (UGent) | Henri Broch | Laura Calabrese (ULB) | Axel Cleeremans (ULB) | Thomas Durand | Elisabeth Feytit | Marius Gilbert (ULB) | Olivier Klein (ULB) | Eric Muraille (ULB) | C\u00e9line Rase (UNamur) | Olivier Sartenaer (UNamur) | Athanasia Symeonidou (Howest University) | Barbara Truffin (ULB) | Nathan Uyttendaele (UCL) | Jean- Paul Van Bendegem (VUB) | Bavo Van Kerrebroeck (McGill University)\r\n\r\nTell All The Truth But Tell It Slant - roept allerlei open vragen op: van de verhouding tussen waarheid en kennis, van de tegenstelling tussen zekerheid en twijfel, tot de valkuilen van het liegen; van het schrijven van de geschiedenis tot de complexiteit van geloofssystemen, tot de rol van bewustzijn, geest en lichaam.\r\n\r\nNaast de werken van de kunstenaars zijn wetenschappers, filosofen, epistemologen en deskundigen uit verschillende vakgebieden uitgenodigd om bij te dragen aan de tentoonstelling, waardoor het publiek beschouwingen, visies en overwegingen krijgt vanuit de meest uiteenlopende perspectieven van de hedendaagse samenleving.\r\nWat is waar, hoe wordt dat bepaald en door wie? Heeft de wetenschap altijd gelijk?","performers":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014 verzamelt het werk van 18 Belgische en internationale kunstenaars, samen met de bijdrage van wetenschappers, onderzoekers en deskundigen uit verschillende domeinen.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/studio-fr\/tell-all-the-truth-but-tell-is-slant-fr\/","email":"gwen@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556078"},"en":{"name":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014","shortdescr":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014 is an exhibition exploring the concept of truth and the construction of knowledge, through the relation between art, technology, science and society.","longdescr":"Bringing together works by some 18 Belgian and international artists, this exhibition borrows its title from Emily Dickinson's poem of the same name, in which the poet invites us to be radically honest, but to tell the truth indirectly, obliquely, so as not to shock or overwhelm.\r\n\r\nTell All The Truth But Tell It Slant - raises a variety of open questions: from the relationship between truth and knowledge, from the opposition between certainty and doubt, to the pitfalls of lying; from the writing of history to the complexity of belief systems, to the role of consciousness, mind and body.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the artists' works, scientists, philosophers, epistemologists and experts from different fields have been invited to contribute to the exhibition, offering the public reflections, views and considerations from the most diverse perspectives of contemporary society.\r\nWhat is true, how is it decided and by whom? Is science always right? \r\n\r\nArtists\r\nSajjad Abbas (IQ) | Kim Albrecht (DE) | Mathilde Boussange (BE) | Philippe Braquenier (BE) | Peter de Cupere (BE) | Forensic Architecture (UK) | fuse* (IT) | Yannick Jacquet (FR\/CH), Laurent and Manuel Talbot (BE) | David OReilly (IE) | Matthias Pitscher (DE) | Bill Posters (UK) and Daniel Howe (US) | Margerita Pul\u00e8 (MT) and Elise Billiard-Pisani (FR) | Yoan Robin (FR) | TOAST (AU) | Rose Tytgat (BE) | Gillian Wearing (UK) With the participation of the Maison de la Marionnette de Tournai (BE)\r\n \r\n\r\nScientists, researchers and experts\r\nAllon Bar | Brenda Bikoko (VUB) | Maarten Boudry (UGent) | Henri Broch | Laura Calabrese (ULB) | Axel Cleeremans (ULB) | Thomas Durand | Elisabeth Feytit | Marius Gilbert (ULB) | Olivier Klein (ULB) | Eric Muraille (ULB) | C\u00e9line Rase (UNamur) | Olivier Sartenaer (UNamur) | Athanasia Symeonidou (Howest University) | Barbara Truffin (ULB) | Nathan Uyttendaele (UCL) | Jean- Paul Van Bendegem (VUB) | Bavo Van Kerrebroeck (McGill University)","performers":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014 gathers the work of 18 Belgian and International artists, along with the contribution of scientists, researchers and experts from different domains.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/studio-fr\/tell-all-the-truth-but-tell-is-slant-fr\/","email":"gwen@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556078"},"de":{"name":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/studio-fr\/tell-all-the-truth-but-tell-is-slant-fr\/","email":"gwen@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556078"},"it":{"name":"Tell All The Truth But Tell It Slant \u2014","shortdescr":null,"longd