e, Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 ou Rops ne renieraient sans doute pas cet endroit fantasmagorique en plein coeur de Bruxelles !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum voor Fantastische Kunst","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 7","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Brussel is fantastisch! In een herenhuis in de Amerikaansestraat, op enkele stappen van het Hortamuseum, bevindt zich het Museum voor Fantastische Kunst. Het MAF kwam er op initiatief van Michel Dircken. De compleet atypische collectie ontsluit stukken van verschillende generaties die allemaal gerelateerd zijn aan de fantasiewereld, het bizarre of surrealisme, waarbij alle kunstvormen aan bod komen. Het staat buiten kijf dat kunstenaars als Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 of Rops deze plek nooit hadden willen missen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fantastic Art Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Brussels is fantastic! This museum, one of the most atypical of Brussels, presents pieces of different generations which all link to the fantastic, the strange or surrealism. Its collection mixes many techniques and invites on a journey through the imaginary. Conceived as a cabinet of curiosities, the museum is sure to offer visitors a fantastic and unique walkthrough. As would Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 or Rops, you will not be able to ignore this spooky place in the heart of Brussels!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die st\u00e4ndige Sammlung des Museums f\u00fcr Fantastische Kunst umfasst Werke und Exponate aus unterschiedlichen Epochen, deren gemeinsamer Nenner das Fantastische, das Seltsame oder das Surrealistische ist. Diese absolut atypische Sammlung mischt s\u00e4mtliche Techniken: plastische Kunst, Malerei, Bildhauerei...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAF - Museo de Arte Fant\u00e1stico","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La colecci\u00f3n permanente del Museo de Arte Fant\u00e1stico posee art\u00edculos de diferentes \u00e9pocas: todos tienen algo en com\u00fan con la fantas\u00eda, lo extra\u00f1o y lo surrealista. Esta colecci\u00f3n completamente at\u00edpica mezcla todas las t\u00e9cnicas: artes visuales, pintura y escultura.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1925,"location":{"lat":50.82438824,"lon":4.35482215},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T03:05:31+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:45+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/98a4d9915b3f1c8cd029e79187deb131403e4eef.jpg","width":1920,"