destrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T03:05:54+02:00","published_at":"2023-06-28T15:50:12+02:00","backoffice_id":280665,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.25131581370972},{"id":555449,"date_start":"2023-04-20","date_end":"2023-08-25","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,42],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Peinture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Schilderkunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Painting"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Malerei"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Pittura"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Pintura"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":"Isidore Isou, influences, proximit\u00e9s et prolongements.\r\nPlusieurs g\u00e9n\u00e9rations d\u2019artistes t\u00e9moignent via \u0153uvres d\u2019art, manifestations, livres, documents.\u00a0","longdescr":"Isidore Isou, son ombre port\u00e9e sur ses contemporains tel qu\u2019il appara\u00eet \u00e0 travers documents, \u0153uvres d\u2019art et articles de revues rapportant ses pol\u00e9miques. Mais une ombre port\u00e9e sur le futur aussi, selon la formule par laquelle il terminait souvent ses expos\u00e9s\u00a0: \u00ab\u00a0\u2026 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 paradisiaque dans le cosmos de l\u2019\u00e9ternit\u00e9 concr\u00e8te\u00a0\u00bb. Pour ce, il avait imagin\u00e9, sorte laisser-passer vers le futur, un livre, La cr\u00e9atique ou la novatique, dans lequel il expliquait l\u2019art de cr\u00e9er dans la vie et tous les domaines de la culture, sans interruption, partout et tout le temps.\u00a0\r\n\r\nIsou appara\u00eet sous une forme contrast\u00e9e. Il y a loin du jeune \u00ab\u00a0hound dog\u00a0\u00bb, \u00e0 mi-chemin de Richard Huelsenbeck et Jonny Rotten d\u00e9crit par Greil Marcus au th\u00e9oricien du Soul\u00e8vement de la Jeunesse ou de l\u2019Art Infinit\u00e9simal.","performers":"Art & Language, Jacques Andr\u00e9, Ben Vautier, Antoine Boute et Jeanne Pruvot-Simonneaux, Marcel Broodthaers, Anne Catherine Caron, Henri Chopin, Guy Debord, Fran\u00e7ois Dufr\u00eane, Jean-Pierre Gillard, Raymond Hains, Yves Klein, Joseph Kosuth, Maurice Lema\u00eetre, Gabriel Pomerand, Dominique Rappez, Roland Sabatier, Alain Sati\u00e9, Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Studeny, Jacques Villegl\u00e9, Gil Wolman","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"nl":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"en":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":"Isidore Isou, influences, proximities and prolongations. Several generations of artists testify via artworks, manifestations, books and documents.","longdescr":"Isidore Isou's influence on his contemporaries appears in various forms including documents, artworks and magazine articles reporting on his controversial ideas. However, his influence extends beyond his time and is exemplified in a phrase he often used to end his talks : \"\u2026 until we reach a paradisical society in the cosmos of concrete eternity.\" To achieve this, he formulated a guide to creativity and innovation in all areas of culture and life, without interruption, everywhere and at all times, which he detailed in his book\u00a0La\u00a0cr\u00e9atique ou la novatique\u00a0('Creatics or Novatics').\r\n\r\nDespite his significant impact, Isou's persona is complex, as he evolved from the young \"hound dog\", halfway between Richard Huelsenbeck and Jonny Rotten as described by Greil Marcus, to the theoretician of the Youth Uprising and Infinitesimal Art.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"de":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"it":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"sp":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"pt":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"},"cn":{"name":"Isou's Not Dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","email":"info@garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555449"}},"place":{"id":270630,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Garage Cosmos","address_street_name":"Avenue des sept bonniers","address_street_number":"43","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@garagecosmos.be","website":"http:\/\/www.garagecosmos.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 344 88 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue des sept bonniers, 43","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"garage","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Garage Cosmos","address_street_name":"Zevenbunderslaan","address_street_number":"43","address_street_box":null,"email":"i