en voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Assistenzhund","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Cane guida","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T02:35:31+02:00","published_at":"2023-03-30T15:33:28+02:00","backoffice_id":274601,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.21877559624976},{"id":559690,"date_start":"2023-06-28","date_end":"2024-01-21","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,46],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Multidisciplinair"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Multidisciplinary"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Multidisziplin\u00e4r"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Multidisciplinare"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Multidisciplinar"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Exposition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":"Do we have the choice ? \r\n\r\nAvons-nous toujours la possibilit\u00e9 de choisir notre travail ? Pourquoi certaines cat\u00e9gories de personnes sont-elles susceptibles d\u2019\u00eatre rel\u00e9gu\u00e9es dans des emplois dits de \"seconde zone\" ? Sommes-nous invariablement d\u00e9termin\u00e9s \u00e0 contribuer \u00e0 un march\u00e9 de l\u2019emploi  in\u00e9galitaire ou avons-nous, comme consommateur, la possibilit\u00e9 d\u2019un choix  ?","longdescr":"L\u2019article 23 de la D\u00e9claration universelle stipule : \u00ab Toute personne a droit au travail, au libre choix de son travail, \u00e0 des conditions \u00e9quitables et satisfaisantes de travail et \u00e0 la protection contre le ch\u00f4mage. Toute personne, sans aucune discrimination, a droit \u00e0 un salaire \u00e9gal pour un travail \u00e9gal \u00bb.\r\n\r\nL\u2019exposition \u00ab Unfree Labor \u00bb nous invite \u00e0 explorer la transition floue entre un travail libre et non libre.  Loin d\u2019\u00eatre cantonn\u00e9 \u00e0 des p\u00e9riodes les plus noires de notre histoire r\u00e9cente, le travail contraint demeure aujourd\u2019hui encore une r\u00e9alit\u00e9. Les visiteurs y apprendront que l\u2019absence de choix implique in\u00e9vitablement une relation de dominance-subordination. \r\n\r\n\u00ab Unfree Labor\u201d est une exposition engag\u00e9e qui invite les visiteurs \u00e0 r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir et \u00e0 prendre position sur des situations v\u00e9cues aujourd\u2019hui en Allemagne, en Belgique et au Grand-Duch\u00e9 de Luxembourg. Dans nos pays riches et dits d\u00e9mocratiques, quelle est notre marge de libert\u00e9 en prenant un emploi ?  Dans quelle mesure la coercition \u00e9conomique, juridique ou \u00e9motionnelle pousse-t-elle une personne \u00e0 accepter un travail pouvant pr\u00e9senter des conditions injustes ?\r\n\r\nAllemagne, Belgique, Luxembourg : trois pays si proches, mais aussi parfois tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rents dans leurs rapports \u00e0 l\u2019emploi. A travers le cas des livreurs \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, des travailleurs domestiques, des abattoirs, du travail du sexe sur internet ou du travail carc\u00e9ral, cette exposition nous propose de r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir aux r\u00e9alit\u00e9s v\u00e9cues par nombre de travailleurs pr\u00e9caris\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n\u00ab Unfree Labor \u00bb est une exposition qui informe mais pose aussi beaucoup de questions qui d\u00e9rangent.  Elle souhaite aider le visiteur \u00e0 mieux comprendre ce monde du travail que nous partageons.\r\n\r\nL\u2019exposition est \u00e9galement le r\u00e9sultat d\u2019une d\u00e9marche active d\u2019\u00e9tudiants d\u2019universit\u00e9s et d\u2019\u00e9tablissements sup\u00e9rieurs de ces trois pays et qui apporte un regard novateur et in\u00e9dit de la jeune g\u00e9n\u00e9ration sur des questions soci\u00e9tales.","performers":"Partenariat : \r\n\r\n\r\nUniversit\u00e9 du Luxembourg (LU)\r\nUniversit\u00e9 de Li\u00e8ge (BE)\r\n\u00c9cole sup\u00e9rieure des Arts Saint-Luc de Li\u00e8ge (BE)\r\nMUAR - Mus\u00e9e vun der Aarbecht, Kayl (LU)\r\nMus\u00e9e La Fonderie, Molenbeek (BE)\r\nMus\u00e9e le Bois du Cazier, Charleroi (BE)\r\nDASA \u2013 Arbeitswelt Ausstellung, Dortmund (DE)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"nl":{"name":"tentoonstelling Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"en":{"name":"Exhibition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"de":{"name":"Exposition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"it":{"name":"Exposition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"sp":{"name":"Exposition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"pt":{"name":"Exposition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"},"cn":{"name":"Exposition Unfree Labor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","email":"reservation@lafonderie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559690"}},"place":{"id":214813,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Fonderie - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois des industries et du travail","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"La Fonderie propose depuis pr\u00e8s de 30 ans des visites guid\u00e9es en ville, en bateau et \u00e0 pied. R\u00e9guli\u00e8rement mises \u00e0 jour, et compl\u00e9t\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de nouveaux th\u00e8mes ou dispositifs, ces visites ont fait notre renomm\u00e9e et drainent chaque ann\u00e9e plusieurs milliers de visiteurs. \r\n\r\nAllant des enfants  jusqu\u2019aux groupes de seniors, le public vis\u00e9 par nos parcours est large. La plupart des visites sont disponibles \u00e0 la fois selon un calendrier fix\u00e9 pour les individuels et familles, et pour les groupes sur demande. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Fonderie - Brussels museum voor arbeid en industrie","address_street_name":"Ransfortstraat 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Ransfortstraat 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Hebt u wat tijd om op ontdekkingstocht te gaan in Brussel? Zin om de hoofdstad op een originele manier te verkennen? Dan zijn onze rondleidingen beslist iets voor u!\r\nDeze stadsroutes met verschillende thema's behandelen kwesties die diep geworteld zitten in het verleden, maar waarvan het heden ons dagelijks interpelleert: wie arbeid of industrie zegt, spreekt meteen ook over stedelijke groei, immigratie, sociale hulp, woningen. Sommige bezoeken zijn geconcentreerd op een wijk, andere gaan over economische, politieke of sociale kwesties. Er zijn een twintigtal routes voor een gevarieerd publiek beschikbaar in meerdere talen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Fonderie - Brussels museum of work and industry","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":" La Fonderie's tour guides invite visitors to discover Brussels so they may better understand and analyse the city.\r\nThe urban guided tours with their varied themes address questions deeply rooted in the past but which relate to modern, everyday life such as: work, industrial techniques, urban growth, immigration, social welfare and housing. Some visits concentrate on a neighbourhood; others ask questions related to economic, political or social issues. More than twenty tours are available in several languages for a large and diverse public.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Fonderie - Br\u00fcsseler Museum f\u00fcr Industrie und Arbeit","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean