"visit_profile":{"list":[332],"translations":{"fr":["LGBTQIA+"],"nl":["LGBTQIA+"],"en":["LGBTQIA+"],"de":["LGBTQIA+"],"it":["LGBTQIA+"],"sp":["LGBTQIA+"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"tags":["brussels_pride"],"is_part_of":"Brussels Pride","accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T02:35:28+02:00","published_at":"2023-05-10T11:58:44+02:00","backoffice_id":276978,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.17597648705188},{"id":550753,"date_start":"2023-06-01","date_end":"2024-06-01","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,43],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts D\u00e9coratifs"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Decoratieve kunsten"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Decorative art"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Dekorative K\u00fcnste"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Arti decorative"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Artes decorativas"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Art(s) Nouveau(x) Belge(s). Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":"Pour sa premi\u00e8re exposition, la Maison Hannon souhaite pr\u00e9senter l\u2019art nouveau dans sa pluralit\u00e9, au travers d'oeuvres majeures, issues des plus grandes collections d'art belge.","longdescr":"En 1900, alors que la r\u00e9volution industrielle bat son plein, Bruxelles est le terrain d\u2019exp\u00e9rimentations d\u2019un style subversif : l\u2019Art Nouveau. Un style ? Non, un \u00e9tat d\u2019esprit et une foi insatiable en la modernit\u00e9 !\r\n\r\nAlors que Victor Horta s\u2019adresse \u00e0 une client\u00e8le ais\u00e9e, Paul Hankar, Henry van de Velde et Gustave Serrurier-Bovy \u0153uvrent de concert \u00e0 l\u2019invention d\u2019un mode de vie moderne, plus simple et d\u00e9pouill\u00e9, vou\u00e9 \u00e0 une large diffusion. Par cette d\u00e9marche engag\u00e9e, ils se veulent acteur du changement et installent durablement les bases de la premi\u00e8re modernit\u00e9.","performers":"Design Musem Gent, VUB, Jonathan Mangelinckx Collection, Klassik Stiftung Weimar, Spa Museum, Grand Curtius, Mus\u00e9e d'Ixelles et d'autres collectionneurs priv\u00e9s.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"nl":{"name":"Belgische art nouveau. Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":"Voor haar eerste tentoonstelling wil het Maison Hannon de Belgische art nouveau in al zijn verscheidenheid presenteren aan de hand van belangrijke werken uit enkele van de meest vooraanstaande collecties van Belgische kunst.","longdescr":"In 1900, toen de industri\u00eble revolutie in volle gang was, werd in Brussel ge\u00ebxperimenteerd met een subversieve stijl: de art nouveau. Een stijl? Nee, een gemoedstoestand en een onverzadigbaar geloof in de moderniteit!\r\n\r\nTerwijl Victor Horta zich richtte op een rijk client\u00e8le, werkten Paul Hankar, Henry van de Velde en Gustave Serrurier-Bovy samen om een moderne manier van leven uit te vinden, eenvoudiger en overzichtelijker, bestemd voor een wijde verspreiding. Door deze ge\u00ebngageerde aanpak wilden zij pioniers van verandering zijn en op lange termijn de basis leggen voor de eerste moderniteit.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"en":{"name":"Belgian Art nouveau. Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":"For its first exhibition, Maison Hannon presents Art Nouveau in its plurality through some of the main artworks from the most prestigious collections of belgian art.","longdescr":"In 1900, while the industrial revolution was in full swing, Brussels was the site of experiments in a subversive style: Art Nouveau. A style? No, a state of mind and an insatiable faith in modernity!\r\n\r\nWhile Victor Horta addressed himself to a wealthy clientele, Paul Hankar, Henry van de Velde and Gustave Serrurier-Bovy worked to invent a modern way of life, simpler and more uncluttered, destined for wide distribution. Through this committed approach, they wanted to be actors of change and to establish the foundations of the first modernity.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"de":{"name":"Art(s) Nouveau(x) Belge(s). Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"it":{"name":"Art(s) Nouveau(x) Belge(s). Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"sp":{"name":"Art(s) Nouveau(x) Belge(s). Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"pt":{"name":"Art(s) Nouveau(x) Belge(s). Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"},"cn":{"name":"Art(s) Nouveau(x) Belge(s). Van de Velde, Serrurier-Bovy, Hankar & Co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/maisonhannon.be\/fr","email":"visit@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 669 68 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 669 68 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550753"}},"place":{"id":244861,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Maison Hannon, \u00e0 l\u2019angle des avenues Brugmann et de la Jonction, a \u00e9t\u00e9 construite en 1902, \u00e0 la demande du couple Marie et \u00c9douard Hannon, par leur ami l\u2019architecte Jules Brunfaut. Con\u00e7ue comme univers symboliste et onirique, la maison est un des chefs-d\u2019\u0153uvre de l\u2019art nouveau \u00e0 Bruxelles, union de l\u2019art belge et de l\u2019art fran\u00e7ais de l\u2019\u00e9poque. \r\n\r\nJules Brunfaut, peu familier au style nouveau, s\u2019inspirera d\u2019autres maisons d\u2019architectes de l\u2019\u00e9poque, tel que celles de Victor Horta (maison personnelle, h\u00f4tels Tassel et Wessinger), d\u2019Ernest Bl\u00e9rot (maison personnelle, aujourd\u2019hui d\u00e9truite) et d\u2019Octave Van Rysselbeghe et Henry Van de Velde (h\u00f4tel Otlet). \r\n\r\nAlliant style beaux-arts \u00e0 celui de la modernit\u00e9, soit l\u2019art nouveau \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, la Maison Hannon est une \u0153uvre singuli\u00e8re, une maison intime et personnelle, r\u00e9unissant les go\u00fbts et passions de ses commanditaires. \r\n\r\nLa Maison Hannon ouvre ses portes au public le 1er juin 2023, en tant que maison-mus\u00e9e.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hannon Huis","address_street_name":"Verbindingslaan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Verbindingslaan, 1","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Het Maison Hannon werd in 1902 gebouwd op de hoek van de Brugmannlaan en de Verbindingslaan in Sint-Gillis door de architect Jules Brunfaut op verzoek van het echtpaar Marie en \u00c9douard Hannon. Het huis, opgevat als een droomachtig, symbolistische omsloten wereld, is een van de meesterwerken van de Brusselse art nouveau, een vereniging van Belgische en Franse kunst uit die tijd.\r\n\r\nJules Brunfaut, onbekend met de nouveau-stijl, liet zich inspireren door de huizen van andere architecten uit die tijd, zoals die van Victor Horta (persoonlijk huis, hotels Tassel en Wessinger), Ernest Bl\u00e9rot (persoonlijk huis, nu vernietigd) en Octave Van Rysselbeghe en Henry Van de Velde (hotel Otlet). \r\nHet Maison Hannon combineert de Beaux-Arts stijl met die van de moderniteit, de toenmalige art nouveau, en is een uniek werk, een intiem en persoonlijk huis dat de smaak en de passies van zijn opdrachtgevers samenbrengt. \r\n\r\nHet Maison Hannon zal op 1 juni 2023 de deuren voor het publiek openen als huis-museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Hannon House","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"The Maison Hannon, on the corner of Avenue Brugmann and Avenue de la Jonction, was built in 1902, at the request of the couple Marie and \u00c9douard Hannon, by their friend, the architect Jules Brunfaut. Conceived as a symbolist and dreamlike universe, the house is one of the masterpieces of art nouveau in Brussels, a union of Belgian and French art of the time. \r\nJules Brunfaut, unfamiliar with the new style, was inspired by other architects' houses, such as those of Victor Horta (personal house, Tassel and Wessinger hotels), Ernest Bl\u00e9rot (personal house, now destroyed) and Octave Van Rysselbeghe and Henry Van de Velde (Otlet hotel). \r\nCombining the beaux-arts style with that of modernity, or art nouveau at that period, the Maison Hannon is a singular work, an intimate and personal house, bringing together the tastes and passions of its commissioners. \r\n\r\nThe Maison Hannon will open its doors to the public on June 1, 2023, as a house museum. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Av. de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Av. de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Edouard Hannon, Ingenieur der Gesellschaft Solvay und einer der Vertreter der industriellen Bourgeoisie, erwarb 1902 ein Grundst\u00fcck an der Avenue Brugman und beauftragte den Architekten Jules Brunfaut mit dem Bau eines prachtvollen Herrenhauses im Jugendstil.\r\n\r\nJules Brunfaut z\u00e4hlte bis dato nicht zu den Jugendstil-Architekten. Er bediente sich dieses Stils lediglich, um seinem Freund und Gesch\u00e4ftspartner einen Gefallen zu tun. 1903, als sich der Jugendstil auch international durchgesetzt hatte, wagte er sich an neue Stilelemente heran: Ihm sind die Fenster im Tiffany-Stil zu verdanken. Und es wird deutlich, wer Brunfauts Vorbilder waren: Victor Horta und Octave van Rijsselberghe (der Architekt des H\u00f4tel Otlet und H\u00f4tel de Brouck\u00e8re).\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","ad