\u0300 tous. L\u2019attraction VR Flybox dure 15 minutes. Vous aurez ensuite acce\u0300s a\u0300 notre Photo Booth\r\nou\u0300 vous pourrez repartir avec un cliche\u0301 original marquant votre passage chez Imagine Belgium.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Imagine Belgium","address_street_name":"Heuvelstraat","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Heuvelstraat, 24","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Dankzij een ultrarealistisch vlieggevoel en meeslepende 360\u00b0-beelden \"stijgt\" de bezoeker op van de Grote Markt voor een vlucht van 15 minuten rond Belgie\u0308. Een originele manier om het land te verkennen, comfortabel en uitgerust met een VR-headset. Flybox wil een culturele en leuke activiteit zijn, toegankelijk voor iedereen.\r\nDe VR Flybox reis duurt 15 minuten. Daarna krijgt u toegang tot onze fotobooth waar je originele foto's kan nemen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Imagine Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue de la Colline","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de la Colline, 24","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Thanks to an incredibly realistic flying sensation and immersive 360\u00b0 images, the visitor \"takes off\" from the Grand Place for a 15-minute flight around Belgium. An original way to explore the country, equipped with a VR headset. Flybox aims to be a cultural and fun activity, accessible to everyone.\r\nThe VR Flybox ride lasts 15 minutes. You will then have access to our Photo Booth where you will be able to leave with an original photo of your visit to Imagine Belgium.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Imagine Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue de la Colline","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Colline, 24","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Imagine Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue de la Colline","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Colline, 24","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Imagine Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue de la Colline","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Colline, 24","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Imagine Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue de la Colline","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"booking@imaginebelgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.imaginebelgium.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Colline, 24","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","descri