dek het volledige programma op brusseldanst.be","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"},"en":{"name":"Preselecties Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"},"de":{"name":"Preselecties Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"},"it":{"name":"Preselecties Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"},"sp":{"name":"Preselecties Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"},"pt":{"name":"Preselecties Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"},"cn":{"name":"Preselecties Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559438"}},"place":{"id":149,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"Rue Auguste Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Auguste Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ce haut lieu culturel flamand, qui existe depuis plus de 30 ans, a b\u00e9n\u00e9fici\u00e9 d\u2019une prodigieuse renaissance. Compl\u00e8tement remis \u00e0 neuf ses diff\u00e9rents espaces, aux excellentes qualit\u00e9s acoustiques et techniques, accueillent id\u00e9alement des cr\u00e9ations qui sortent des sentiers battus. Rien que pour sa vue imprenable sur Bruxelles, le Beurskafee - v\u00e9ritable \u201cShelter urbain\u201d avec sa belle terrasse -  m\u00e9rite d\u00e9j\u00e0 l\u2019escalade. Ouvert du mercredi au samedi, d\u00e8s 17h pendant l'\u00e9t\u00e9. Spectacles intimistes, projections, concerts, jams et showcases y sont r\u00e9guliers. Vendredi et samedi, DJ's d\u00e8s 22h00","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Beusc","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"Auguste Ortsstraat","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Auguste Ortsstraat, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Als Brussels kunstencentrum houdt de Beursschouwburg een vinger aan de pols en gaat ze een levendige dialoog aan met de Brusselse kunstsc\u00e8ne. In de bonte programmering geen monocultuur, maar constante kruisbestuiving: van talen en vormen, disciplines en genres, kunst en dagelijkse realiteit, van feest en ernst. \r\nHet Beurskafee met zijn originele buizenstructuur en dambordvloer heeft een specifieke gezelligheid en charme. Hier ontmoeten de Brusselse wereldburgers elkaar en vinden ook gratis evenementen plaats. Op vrijdag en zaterdag DJ's vanaf 22u tot in de vroege uurtjes. Tijdens de zomer opent het dakterras met  zaal; een ware parel van een stadsterras waar muziekfilms geprojecteerd worden en regelmatig life optredens en een stevige fuif doorgaan. Bij goed weer een fantastische locatie voor je middaglunch of ap\u00e9ro m\u00e9t tapas!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"rue August Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue August Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Apart from a pile of attractively stacked bricks in the heart of Brussels, the Beursschouwburg is, for the time being, principally an inspiring platform for between-the-arts. Here, artists reflect, show, scrap and start again in an ongoing dialogue with thinking and creative Brusseleers. The Beursschouwburg is a melting-pot and a thorn in the side, where art is served while it\u2019s still hot. Where, now and again, artists rattle the programming. Where there\u2019s more to life than art. Where performance, celebration, encounter and craziness all join in a merry dance.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"Rue August Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue August Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Beursschouwburg als hochkar\u00e4tiges und avantgardistisches Kunst-, Kultur- und Veranstaltungszentrum der fl\u00e4mischen Gemeinschaft bringt seit mehr als 30 Jahren frischen Wind in den fl\u00e4mischen Teil des Br\u00fcsseler Kulturlandschaft.\r\n\r\nKonzerte, Theater, Kindertheater, Literatur, Filmvorf\u00fchrungen, Jam-Sessions und Showcases abseits des Mainstreams bestimmen das Programm der fast unaussprechlichen Beursschouwburg (dt. B\u00f6rsentheater).\r\n\r\nBeurskafee: Allein schon f\u00fcr den Ausblick auf Br\u00fcssel und die sch\u00f6ne Terrasse lohnt der Aufstieg in das Beurskafee, wo  mittwochs bis samstags ab 19 Uhr kleine Konzerte, Filmvorf\u00fchrungen und Jam-Sessions stattfinden. \u201eTot ziens!\", wie der Flame sagt. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"rue August Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue August Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Questa mecca culturale fiamminga, che esiste da pi\u00f9 di 30 anni, ha vissuto una prodigiosa rinascita. I suoi vari spazi, rimessi completamente a nuovo e con eccellenti qualit\u00e0 acustiche e tecniche, accolgono perfettamente creazioni fuori dagli schemi. \r\n\r\nBeurskafee: La sola vista panoramica di Bruxelles, ammirabile dalla splendida terrazza di questo \"rifugio urbano\", giustifica la scalata per raggiungerlo. Aperto da mercoled\u00ec a sabato dalle 19:00. Spettacoli intimi, proiezioni, concerti, jam session ed esibizioni sono all'ordine del giorno. Venerd\u00ec e sabato, DJ dalle 22.00\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"rue August Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue August Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Este importante espacio cultural flamenco, que existe desde hace 30 a\u00f1os, ha experimentado un renacimiento prodigioso. Sus distintos espacios, completamente renovados, gozan de unas cualidades ac\u00fasticas y t\u00e9cnicas excelentes e idealmente acogen creaciones fuera de lo com\u00fan. \r\n\r\nBeurskafee: Aunque solo sea por las fabulosas vistas de Bruselas, merece la pena subir a este \u00abrefugio urbano\u00bb, que dispone de una bella terraza. Abierto de mi\u00e9rcoles a s\u00e1bado, a partir de las 19.00, con frecuencia se realizan espect\u00e1culos intimistas, proyecciones, conciertos, jams y presentaciones. Viernes y s\u00e1bado, DJ a partir de las 22.00\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"Rue Auguste Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Auguste Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Beursschouwburg","address_street_name":"Rue Auguste Orts","address_street_number":"20 28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@beursschouwburg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.beursschouwburg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 03 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Auguste Orts, 20 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"