s for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr blinde und sehbehinderte Menschen","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non vedenti e ipovedenti","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-03T10:35:43+02:00","published_at":"2023-07-03T10:15:55+02:00","backoffice_id":280992,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":559188,"date_start":"2023-07-16","date_end":"2023-07-16","date_next":"2023-07-16","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Face aux murs : le quartier des prisons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Derri\u00e8re leur fa\u00e7ade monumentale, les prisons de Saint-Gilles et de Forest se fondent dans les quartiers qui les entourent. En 2022, le pouvoir f\u00e9d\u00e9ral pr\u00e9voit le d\u00e9m\u00e9nagement de ces prisons \u00e0 Haren, dans le nord de Bruxelles. Ce d\u00e9placement hors de la ville provoquera de nombreux changements pour les institutions carc\u00e9rales mais aussi pour l\u2019avenir des sites de Saint-Gilles et de Forest.\r\n\r\nL\u2019ARAU part \u00e0 la rencontre de l\u2019histoire de la construction de ces prisons cellulaires (dont certaines parties devraient bient\u00f4t \u00eatre class\u00e9es) qui ont accompagn\u00e9 l\u2019\u00e9volution de quartiers particuli\u00e8rement riches en patrimoine et en perspectives urbaines. Aujourd\u2019hui, l\u2019int\u00e9gration de ce patrimoine p\u00e9nitentiaire unique pose la question des raccords avec les quartiers, pas toujours \u00e9vidents : comment la reconversion de pr\u00e8s de 10 hectares permettra-t-elle de cr\u00e9er de nouveaux liens avec la ville sans d\u00e9naturer l\u2019identit\u00e9 et la m\u00e9moire de ces complexes historiques hors-normes ?","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559188"},"nl":{"name":"Face aux murs : le quartier des prisons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559188"},"en":{"name":"Face aux murs : le quartier des prisons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559188"},"de":{"name":"Face aux murs : le quartier des prisons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_book