:{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"],"de":["Norden"],"it":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":30165,"location":{"lat":50.88765356,"lon":4.34001831},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-06-09T16:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2017-10-13T14:24:47+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":204134,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Comprendre Bruxelles pour mieux la d\u00e9fendre !\r\nL\u2019ARAU a \u00e9t\u00e9 fond\u00e9 en 1969, dans un contexte de \u00ab bruxellisation \u00bb et d\u2019exode des Bruxellois vers la p\u00e9riph\u00e9rie. L\u2019enjeu \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, toujours d\u2019actualit\u00e9 : d\u00e9fendre et promouvoir la ville habit\u00e9e et une qualit\u00e9 de vie pour tous les Bruxellois, ce qui s\u2019est traduit par d\u2019importantes contestations de projets de d\u00e9molition d\u2019une part et le d\u00e9veloppement de contre-projets d\u2019autre part, dans une optique de r\u00e9novation urbaine et d\u2019am\u00e9lioration du cadre de vie.\r\nL\u2019ARAU entend, par son action de sensibilisation et d\u2019information de la population, mettre \u00e0 disposition du public les outils n\u00e9cessaires pour suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution de la ville. Cette action se mat\u00e9rialise \u00e0 travers la publication d\u2019analyses et d\u2019\u00e9tudes, l\u2019organisation de colloques et d\u2019ateliers, des communiqu\u00e9s de presse, \u2026ainsi que de visites guid\u00e9es.\r\nCes visites, pionni\u00e8res en r\u00e9gion bruxelloise et organis\u00e9es depuis 1977, visent \u00e0 revaloriser la ville et ses atouts, \u00e0 d\u00e9velopper un regard critique sur ses transformations, ce qui passe par la sauvegarde et l\u2019entretien de son patrimoine.\r\nAu fil de toutes ces ann\u00e9es, l\u2019ARAU a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 un riche catalogue de visites guid\u00e9es se d\u00e9clinant en diverses th\u00e9matiques : \u00ab Bruxelles incontournable \u00bb, \u00ab Architecture \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles en quartiers \u00bb, \u00ab La ville en transformation \u00bb, \u00ab Parcours d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 \u00bb, \u00ab Une maison bruxelloise \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles : ville de trams \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles sociale \u00bb, qu\u2019il est possible de d\u00e9couvrir lors de tours publics ou sous forme de visites priv\u00e9es, personnalisables.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Zuidstraat","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zuidstraat, 165","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Brussel begrijpen om het beter te kunnen verdedigen!\r\nHet ARAU werd opgericht in 1969, in een context van \u201cBrusselisering\u201d en de uittocht van de Brusselaars naar de rand. De uitdaging van die tijd, die ook vandaag nog actueel is, bestond erin de bewoonde stad en de levenskwaliteit van alle Brusselaars te verdedigen en te bevorderen. Dat leidde tot grote protesten tegen afbraakprojecten enerzijds en de ontwikkeling van tegenprojecten anderzijds, met het oog op stadsvernieuwing en verbetering van de leefomgeving.\r\nHet ARAU wil met zijn bewustmakings- en voorlichtingsactie de bevolking de nodige instrumenten aanreiken om de evolutie van de stad te volgen. Deze actie neemt de vorm aan van de publicatie van analyses en studies, de organisatie van conferenties en workshops, perscommuniqu\u00e9s, enz. en rondleidingen.\r\nDeze rondleidingen, die baanbrekend zijn in het Brusselse Gewest en al sinds 1977 worden georganiseerd, hebben tot doel de stad en haar troeven tot hun recht te laten komen en een kritische kijk te ontwikkelen op haar transformaties, die ook het behoud en de instandhouding van haar erfgoed inhouden.\r\nIn de loop der jaren heeft het ARAU een rijke catalogus van rondleidingen over verschillende thema\u2019s samengesteld: \u201cOnmisbaar Brussel\u201d, \u201cArchitectuur\u201d, \u201cBrussel in wijken\u201d, \u201cDe stad in transformatie\u201d, \u201cZomerreis\u201d, \u201cEen Brussels huis\u201d, \u201cBrussel: stad van de trams\u201d, \u201cSociaal Brussel\u201d, die tijdens openbare rondleidingen of in de vorm van priv\u00e9rondleidingen op maat kunnen worden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Understanding Brussels to better defend it!\r\nARAU was founded in 1969, in a context of \u2018Brusselsisation\u2019 and the exodus of Brussels residents to the periphery. The challenge at the time, which is still relevant today, was to defend and promote the inhabited city and a quality of life for all the inhabitants of Brussels. This led to major protests against demolition projects on the one hand and the development of counter-projects on the other, with a view to urban renewal and improving the living environment.\r\nThe ARAU intends, through its action to raise awareness and inform the population, to provide the public with the necessary tools to monitor the evolution of the city. This action takes the form of the publication of analyses and studies, the organisation of conferences and workshops, press releases, etc., as well as guided tours.\r\nThese tours, which are pioneering in the Brussels region and have been organised since 1977, aim to enhance the city and its assets, and to develop a critical view of its transformations, which includes the preservation and maintenance of its heritage.\r\nOver the years, the ARAU has developed a rich catalogue of guided tours on various themes: \u201cUnmissable Brussels\u201d, \u201cArchitecture\u201d, \u201cBrussels in Districts\u201d, \u201cThe City in Transformation\u201d, \u201cSummer Journey\u201d, \u201cA Brussels House\u201d, \u201cBrussels: City of Trams\u201d, \u201cSocial Brussels\u201d, which can be discovered during public tours or in the form of private, customised tours.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":422,"location":{"lat":50.84343195,"lon":4.34634563},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-06-09T16:05:05+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/9b9a0398c586f13f4959aabeaa58036121a5f4a2.jpg","width":3456,"height":5184,"ratio":0.67,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Les Marolles","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-07-22","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":12},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Etudiants"},"nl":{"name":"Studenten"},"en":{"name":"Students"},"de":{"name":"Studierende"},"it":{"name":"Studenti"},"sp":{"name":"Estudiantes"},"pt":{"name":"Etudiants"},"cn":{"name":"Etudiants"}},"value":8},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"},"de":{"name":"Senioren"},"it":{"name":"Anziani"},"sp":{"name":"Mayores"},"pt":{"name":"Seniors"},"cn":{"name":"Seniors"}},"value":8},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-06-09T16:05:05+02:00","published_at":"2023-06-09T15:50:38+02:00","backoffice_id":279190,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":558772,"date_start":"2023-07-22","date_end":"2023-08-06","date_next":"2023-07-22","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,46],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Multidisciplinair"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Multidisciplinary"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Multidisziplin\u00e4r"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Multidisciplinare"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Multidisciplinar"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"\"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez la richesse et la diversit\u00e9 de la culture chinoise lors de cette semaine in\u00e9dite. Plongez dans l'univers de la Chine \u00e0 travers une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d'activit\u00e9s captivantes qui vous transporteront dans un voyage unique.","longdescr":"Semaine culturelle chinoise au MigratieMuseumMigration !\r\n\r\nD\u00e9couvrez la richesse et la diversit\u00e9 de la culture chinoise lors de cette semaine in\u00e9dite. Plongez dans l'univers de la Chine \u00e0 travers une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d'activit\u00e9s captivantes qui vous transporteront dans un voyage unique.\r\n\r\nAssistez \u00e0 un d\u00e9fil\u00e9 de mode chinois, o\u00f9 les magnifiques cr\u00e9ations traditionnelles et contemporaines se rencontrent sur le podium. D\u00e9couvrez l'art martial embl\u00e9matique de la Chine lors des cours de kungfu. Des instructeurs exp\u00e9riment\u00e9s vous guideront \u00e0 travers les mouvements gracieux et puissants du kungfu, vous permettant de vous immerger dans cette discipline mill\u00e9naire.\r\n\r\nPour les amateurs de th\u00e9, ne manquez pas les ateliers sur le th\u00e9 chinois. Plongez dans l'histoire riche de cette boisson ancestrale et laissez-vous envo\u00fbter par les ar\u00f4mes subtils et les saveurs d\u00e9licates du th\u00e9 chinois.\r\nCette exposition vous offre une occasion unique de d\u00e9couvrir la Chine sous un nouvel angle. Explorez des aspects fascinants de sa culture, de son art et de ses traditions \u00e0 travers des activit\u00e9s interactives qui \u00e9veilleront vos sens et enrichiront vos connaissances.\r\n\r\nQue vous soyez passionn\u00e9 par la mode, int\u00e9ress\u00e9 par les arts martiaux ou tout simplement avide de nouvelles exp\u00e9riences, cette exposition saura vous captiver et vous inspirer.\r\n\r\nR\u00e9servation :\r\n+32 2 609 55 61 museum@foyer.be","performers":"Yang Fan (Yellow Vitamines)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558772"},"nl":{"name":"\"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortdescr":"Ontdek de rijkdom en diversiteit van de Chinese cultuur tijdens deze unieke week. Duik in de wereld van China met een verscheidenheid aan boeiende activiteiten die je meenemen op een unieke reis.","longdescr":"Chinese Culturele Week in het MigratieMuseumMigration!\r\n\r\nOntdek de rijkdom en diversiteit van de Chinese cultuur tijdens deze unieke week. Duik in de wereld van China met een verscheidenheid aan boeiende activiteiten die je meenemen op een unieke reis.\r\n\r\nBewonder een Chinese modeshow, waar prachtige traditionele en moderne creaties samenkomen op de catwalk. Ontdek de iconische Chinese vechtkunst tijdens kungfu-lessen. Ervaren instructeurs zullen je begeleiden bij gracieuze en krachtige bewegingen, zodat je je kunt onderdompelen in deze eeuwenoude discipline.\r\n\r\nVoor thee liefhebbers mag je de workshops over Chinese thee niet missen. Duik in de rijke geschiedenis van deze eeuwenoude drank en laat je betoveren door de subtiele aroma's en delicate smaken van Chinese thee.\r\nDeze tentoonstelling biedt je een unieke kans om China vanuit een nieuw perspectief te ontdekken. Verken boeiende aspecten van de cultuur, kunst en tradities door middel van interactieve activiteiten die je zintuigen zullen prikkelen en je kennis zullen verrijken.\r\n\r\nOf je nu gepassioneerd bent door mode, ge\u00efnteresseerd bent in vechtkunst of gewoon op zoek bent naar nieuwe ervaringen, deze tentoonstelling zal je boeien en inspireren.\r\n\r\nReserveringen:\r\n+32 2 609 55 61 museum@foyer.be","performers":"Yang Fan (Yellow Vitamines)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558772"},"en":{"name":"\"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortdescr":"Discover the richness and diversity of Chinese culture during this unprecedented week. Immerse yourself in the world of China through a variety of captivating activities that will take you on a unique journey.","longdescr":"Chinese Cultural Week at MigratieMuseumMigration!\r\n\r\nDiscover the richness and diversity of Chinese culture during this unprecedented week. Immerse yourself in the world of China through a variety of captivating activities that will take you on a unique journey.\r\n\r\nWitness a Chinese fashion show, where beautiful traditional and contemporary creations come together on the runway. Experience the iconic Chinese martial art during kungfu classes. Experienced instructors will guide you through the graceful and powerful movements of kungfu, allowing you to immerse yourself in this ancient discipline.\r\n\r\nFor tea enthusiasts, don't miss the workshops on Chinese tea. Dive into the rich history of this ancient beverage and let yourself be enchanted by the subtle aromas and delicate flavors of Chinese tea.\r\n\r\nThis exhibition offers you a unique opportunity to discover China from a fresh perspective. Explore fascinating aspects of its culture, art, and traditions through interactive activities that will awaken your senses and enrich your knowledge.\r\nWhether you are passionate about fashion, interested in martial arts, or simply eager for new experiences, this exhibition will captivate and inspire you.\r\n\r\nReservations:\r\n+32 2 609 55 61 museum@foyer.be","performers":"Yang Fan (Yellow Vitamines)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558772"},"de":{"name":"Exposition \"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558772"},"it":{"name":"Exposition \"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558772"},"sp":{"name":"Exposition \"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558772"},"pt":{"name":"Exposition \"We are family\" Youth culture and art week","shortd