ns":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[109],"translations":{"fr":["Espaces verts"],"nl":["Groene zones"],"en":["Green spaces"],"de":["Gr\u00fcnfl\u00e4chen"],"it":["Spazi verdi"],"sp":["Espacios verdes:"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":"Embarquez pour une aventure d\u2019une journ\u00e9e \u00e0 v\u00e9lo \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre promenade verte bruxelloise.","longdescr":"Embarquez pour une aventure d\u2019une journ\u00e9e \u00e0 v\u00e9lo \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre promenade verte bruxelloise.\r\nCet itin\u00e9raire de 60 km entourant la r\u00e9gion bruxelloise n\u2019est plus \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter aujourd\u2019hui. Reliant les diff\u00e9rents espaces verts de la ville par des chemins d\u00e9tourn\u00e9s  et r\u00e9serv\u00e9s aux pi\u00e9tons et cyclistes, elle permet de d\u00e9couvrir une multitude de paysages et de milieux naturels. De la for\u00eat de Soignes au plateau du Heysel en passant par le Neerpeede et le parc de la Woluwe, enfourchez votre v\u00e9lo pour une mise au vert radicale dans une ambiance conviviale.\r\nIMPORTANT :\r\n* Pr\u00e9voyez un pique-nique pour le temps de midi.\r\n* La balade est athl\u00e9tique au niveau du nombre de km parcourus, le guide s\u2019adapte au groupe et \u00e0 son rythme.\r\n* Il est possible d\u2019arr\u00eater la balade en cours si celle-ci s\u2019av\u00e8re trop longue. Durant le parcours, \u00e0 diff\u00e9rents endroits pr\u00e9cis, le guide vous indiquera le meilleur moyen de reprendre le m\u00e9tro pour rejoindre le centre-ville.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"nl":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":"Maak een dagje vrij en ga op fietsavontuur over de beroemde Groene Wandeling van Brussel.","longdescr":"Maak een dagje vrij en ga op fietsavontuur over de beroemde Groene Wandeling van Brussel.\r\nDeze 60 km lange route rond het Brusselse Gewest hoeft geen introductie meer. De route verbindt de verschillende groene zones van de stad met elkaar via omwegen die zijn voorbehouden aan voetgangers en fietsers en neemt je mee langs talloze landschappen en dwars door natuurgebieden. Van het Zoni\u00ebnwoud tot het Heizelplateau, via de Neerpeede en het Woluwepark, spring op de fiets voor een duik in het groen in een gemoedelijke sfeer.\r\nBELANGRIJK:\r\n* Gelieve een picknick lunch mee te nemen.\r\n* De wandeling is atletisch wat betreft het aantal afgelegde kilometers. De gids past zich aan de groep en haar tempo aan.\r\n* Het is mogelijk om de wandeling te stoppen als deze te lang blijkt te duren. Tijdens de wandeling vertelt de gids u op verschillende punten hoe u met de metro terug kunt komen in het centrum.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"en":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"de":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"it":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"sp":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"pt":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"},"cn":{"name":"La Promenade Verte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.561328"}},"place":{"id":280319,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Dublin","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Dublin, 19","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Le v\u00e9lo accessible \u00e0 toutes et tous\r\nPour d\u00e9velopper et faciliter la pratique du v\u00e9lo en Belgique, Pro Velo  soutient les particuliers, les pouvoirs publics, les \u00e9coles et les entreprises depuis 1992.  Notre offre de services vise \u00e0 rendre le v\u00e9lo accessible \u00e0 tous et toutes au travers d\u2019un accompagnement personnalis\u00e9. Pro Velo contribue ainsi \u00e0 une meilleure qualit\u00e9 de vie !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Dublinstraat","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Dublinstraat, 19","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Fietsen voor iedereen\r\nOm het gebruik van de fiets in Belgi\u00eb te ontwikkelen en te vergemakkelijken steunt Pro Velo sinds 1992 particulieren, overheden, scholen en bedrijven. Onze diensten zijn erop gericht de fiets voor iedereen toegankelijk te maken door middel van persoonlijke ondersteuning. Pro Velo draagt bij tot een betere levenskwaliteit!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Dublin","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Dublin, 19","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Cycling for all\r\nIn order to develop and facilitate the use of the bicycle in Belgium, Pro Velo has been supporting individuals, governments, schools and companies since 1992. Our services are aimed at making cycling accessible to everyone through personal support. This way, Pro Velo contributes to a better quality of life!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Dublin","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","