],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-06-04T02:37:51+02:00","published_at":"2023-04-05T13:26:34+02:00","backoffice_id":274898,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.16797288504298},{"id":560143,"date_start":"2023-07-01","date_end":"2023-09-03","date_next":"2023-09-03","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen","it":"Animazioni","sp":"Animaciones","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeu de piste souterrain","shortdescr":"Un jeu de piste \u00e0 faire en famille","longdescr":"Le petit Charles Quint a besoin de ton aide ! Il a oubli\u00e9 le code pour ouvrir son coffre au tr\u00e9sor. Dans ce coffre, se trouve quelque chose de tr\u00e8s sp\u00e9cial : son collier de l\u2019ordre de la Toison d\u2019or. Charles est \u00e0 la recherche de princesses et de princes valeureux pour l\u2019aider. Si tu r\u00e9ussis, Charles aura certainement une r\u00e9compense pour toi !\r\n\r\nComment \u00e7a se passe ?\r\nChaque enfant re\u00e7oit un sac \u00e0 dos avec du mat\u00e9riel pour effectuer des missions (carte au tr\u00e9sor, d\u00e9guisement, puzzle, lampe de poche\u2026). Chaque mission donne un indice pour trouver le mot de passe qui leur permettra d\u2019ouvrir le coffre au tr\u00e9sor (o\u00f9 se trouve le fameux collier de la Toison d\u2019or). Les enfants re\u00e7oivent un petit cadeau \u00e0 la fin du jeu.\r\n\r\nInformations pratiques\r\nQuand: du 1\/7 au 3\/9. Tous les jours sauf le lundi.\r\nTarifs : 4 \u20ac \/ enfant (+ adulte 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac). Article 27 : 1,25 \u20ac. \r\nLangues : fran\u00e7ais, n\u00e9erlandais, anglais et espagnol\r\nPublic : pour les enfants de 5 \u00e0 8 ans accompagn\u00e9s d\u2019un adulte\r\nR\u00e9servation en ligne possible\r\nActivit\u00e9 en autonomie, sans accompagnateur du Coudenberg\r\nDur\u00e9e : 1h - 1h30","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"nl":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":"Een speurtocht voor het hele gezin","longdescr":"Klein keizer Kareltje heeft jouw hulp nodig! Hij is de code om zijn schatkist te openen vergeten. In die schatkist zit iets heel speciaals: de ketting van de orde van het Gulden Vlies. Kareltje zoekt dappere prinsen en prinsessen om de code te kraken. Durf jij mee op zoek te gaan in het ondergrondse paleis van de Coudenberg? Als je de schatkist kunt openen zal Kareltje je zeker belonen!\r\n\r\nHoe werkt het?\r\nElk kind krijgt een rugzakje met het nodige materiaal om de opdrachten uit te voeren (schatkaart, kostuum, puzzel, zaklamp\u2026). Elke opdracht geeft een aanwijzing om het woord te vinden dat de code is om de schatkist te openen (waarin de beroemde ketting van het Gulden Vlies zit). De kinderen krijgen een kleine verrassing op het einde van het spel.\r\n\r\nPraktische informatie\r\nWanneer: Paasvakantie, van 1\/7 tot 3\/9. Elke dag behalve maandag.\r\nTarief: 4 \u20ac \/ kind (+ volwassene 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac). Artikel 27 : 1,25 \u20ac. \r\nTalen : Nederlands, Frans, Engels, en Spans\r\nDoelgroep : voor kinderen van 5 tot 8 jaar onder begeleiding van een volwassene.\r\nOnline reservatie mogelijk. Bel + 32 (0)2 500 45 54 bij problemen.\r\nZelfstandige activiteit, zonder begeleider van de Coudenberg\r\nDuur : 1u\/1u30","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"en":{"name":"Underground Treasure Hunt","shortdescr":"A treasure hunt for the whole family","longdescr":"Little Charles V needs your help! He has forgotten the code to open his treasure chest. And there\u2019s something very special in that chest: his collar of the order of the Golden Fleece. Little Charles is looking for tough princes and princesses to crack the code. If you succeed, no doubt Charles will reward you!\r\n\r\nHow does it work?\r\nEvery child receives a backpack with the equipment to complete missions (treasure map, fancy dress, puzzle, flashlight...). Every mission gives a clue to find the password that will allow them to open the treasure chest (where the famous collar of the Golden Fleece is). The children receive a small gift at the end of the game.\r\n\r\nPractical information\r\nWhen: every day from 1\/7 to 3\/9, except for Mondays\r\nPrices: 4 \u20ac \/ child (+ adult 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac). Article 27: \u20ac1.25. Members Gezinsbond: children -14 years old: \u20ac2 \/ adultes: \u20ac5\r\nLanguages: French, Dutch, English and Spanish\r\nPublic: suitable for children from 5 to 8 years old accompanied by an adult.\r\nOnline reservation possible. Self-guided activity, without a Coudenberg guide\r\nDuration: 1h - 1h30","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"de":{"name":"Jeu de piste souterrain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"it":{"name":"Jeu de piste souterrain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"sp":{"name":"Jeu de piste souterrain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"pt":{"name":"Jeu de piste souterrain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"},"cn":{"name":"Jeu de piste souterrain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560143"}},"place":{"id":227859,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n\r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. \r\n\r\nPlongez dans l'histoire prestigieuse de Bruxelles et de son palais !\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. \r\n\r\nVele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt. \r\n\r\nLaat je onderdompelen in de prestigieuze geschiedenis van Brussel en zijn paleis!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire. Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archaeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n\r\nDuring a visit, explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground. \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the prestigious history of Brussels and its palace!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","descrip