 d\u00e9co"],"it":["Art Nouveau, Art D\u00e9co"],"sp":["Art nouveau, art d\u00e9co"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"L'h\u00f4tel Solvay et ses innovations techniques","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De 1894 \u00e0 1898, Victor Horta construit pour Armand Solvay, le fils du c\u00e9l\u00e8bre industriel Ernest Solvay, le plus prestigieux des h\u00f4tels de ma\u00eetre Art nouveau \u00e0 Bruxelles. Construction majeure du ma\u00eetre de l'Art nouveau Victor Horta, il a la chance d'avoir conserv\u00e9 tous ses \u00e9l\u00e9ments d'origine : mobilier, luminaires, tentures et objets d'art de l'\u00e9poque.\r\nNous vous ferons d\u00e9couvrir les innovations techniques que Victor Horta a mis en \u0153uvre pour la structure du b\u00e2timent mais aussi dans l'am\u00e9nagement int\u00e9rieur de cet h\u00f4tel de Ma\u00eetre.\r\nClass\u00e9 au patrimoine mondial de l'UNESCO, c'est un \u00e9crin unique, o\u00f9 la notion d'art total prend ici tout son sens.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/fr\/node\/879","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 45 60","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555552"},"nl":{"name":"L'h\u00f4tel Solvay et ses innovations techniques","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/fr\/node\/879","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 45 60","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555552"},"en":{"name":"L'h\u00f4tel Solvay et ses innovations techniques","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/fr\/node\/879","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 45 60","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agend