{"data":[{"id":560527,"date_start":"2023-07-08","date_end":"2023-07-09","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"fr":"Festival","nl":"Festival","en":"Festival","de":"Festival","it":"Festival","sp":"Festival","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Take OFF 2023 : Festival d'artistes \u00e9mergents","shortdescr":"Festival d'artistes \u00e9mergents","longdescr":"Le festival Take Off est un \u00e9v\u00e9nement incontournable pour tous les amateurs d'art, de musique et de divertissement. Il aura lieu les 8 et 9 juillet \u00e0 la Vall\u00e9e, un lieu magique qui mettra en valeur les performances des artistes passionn\u00e9s et talentueux qui y participeront.\r\n\r\nPr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 assister \u00e0 la transformation de Bruxelles en une toile vibrante de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9, alors que des artistes talentueux se r\u00e9unissent pour pr\u00e9senter leurs \u0153uvres \u00e9tonnantes.\r\nC'est une c\u00e9l\u00e9bration de l'art sous toutes ses formes, du graffiti aux peintures murales de rue, en passant par les installations et tout ce qui se trouve entre les deux.\r\n\r\nCe festival promet d'\u00eatre une exp\u00e9rience unique, avec une programmation vari\u00e9e qui saura plaire \u00e0 tous les go\u00fbts. Des nouveaux talents seront pr\u00e9sents pour vous faire vibrer et vous en mettre plein la vue et les oreilles.\r\n\r\nSi vous cherchez un endroit pour vous amuser, d\u00e9couvrir de nouveaux talents, appr\u00e9cier de la bonne musique et passer un bon moment en famille ou entre amis, le festival Take Off est l'endroit id\u00e9al pour vous. Nous avons r\u00e9uni pour vous 30 artistes \u00e9mergents de tous genres. Venez les d\u00e9couvrir avec nous !\r\n\r\nNe manquez pas cette occasion de d\u00e9couvrir le meilleur de l'art en un seul endroit.\r\nVenez d\u00e9couvrir de nouveaux talents avec nous !\r\n--------------------------------------------------------\r\nThe Take Off Festival is a must-attend event for art, music, and entertainment enthusiasts. It will take place on July 8th and 9th at La Vall\u00e9e, a magical venue that will showcase the performances of passionate and talented artists participating in the festival.\r\n\r\nGet ready to witness Brussels transform into a vibrant canvas of creativity as talented artists come together to showcase their astonishing works. This festival is a celebration of art in all its forms, from graffiti to street murals, installations, and everything in between.\r\n\r\nThe festival promises to be a unique experience with a diverse lineup that caters to all tastes. Exciting new talents will be there to thrill and captivate you with their stunning visual and auditory displays.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a place to have fun, discover new talents, enjoy great music, and have a good time with family or friends, the Take Off Festival is the perfect destination for you.We have brought together 30 emerging artists of all genres for you. Come and discover them with us!\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity to experience the best of art in one place. Come and discover new talents with us!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.airplanemodebe.com","email":"info@airplanemode.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560527"},"nl":{"name":"Take OFF 2023 : Festival d'artistes \u00e9mergents","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.airplanemodebe.com","email":"info@airplanemode.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/