785,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"festival","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.51087295492904},{"id":559224,"date_start":"2023-07-01","date_end":"2023-07-16","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen","it":"Animazioni","sp":"Animaciones","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":"Les trois premiers weekends de juillet, le Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l\u2019exil vous invite \u00e0 une kermesse des jeux du monde, un voyage artistique et qui vous transportera dans une atmosph\u00e8re joyeuse et insolite o\u00f9 l\u2019on peut jouer avec l\u2019art et s\u2019amuser avec des jeux traditionnels originaires des quatre coins du monde.","longdescr":"Au programme : une exposition pens\u00e9e comme un Luna Park multiculturel, des ateliers cr\u00e9atifs, des tournois de jeux, un escape game en plein air, des concerts\u2026\r\n\r\nWeekend #1 (01.07 + 02.07) : jeux traditionnels par-del\u00e0 les fronti\u00e8res \u00b7 escape game \u00b7 expo \u00b7 workshops \r\n\r\nWeekend #2 (08\/07 + 09\/07) : jeux vid\u00e9os \u00b7 escape game \u00b7 expo \u00b7 workshops \r\n+ concert du Duo Bram\u00e9 Bicama (balafon \u00b7 percussions \u00b7 originaire du Burkina-Faso) - \r\n\r\nWeekend #3 (15\/07 + 16\/07) : jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9 modernes \u00b7 escape game \u00b7 expo \u00b7 workshops\r\n\r\nChaque samedi (01\/07 + 08\/07 + 15\/07) de 14h30 \u00e0 17h \r\nEscape game MATONGE (gratuit \u00b7 sur inscription) \r\nMax 15 participants par session ! \r\nR\u00e9servez votre place par email \u00e0 medexmuseum@gmail.com\r\n\r\nParticipation gratuite \r\nCet \u00e9v\u00e8nement b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie du soutien de la commune d'Ixelles dans le cadre de l'initiative Summer XL. \r\n\r\nToutes les infos sur la page de l'\u00e9v\u00e8nement : https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"nl":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":"De eerste drie weekends van juli nodigt het Tijdelijk Museum van de Ballingschap je uit voor een kermisspelletjesfeest, een artistieke reis die je meeneemt naar een vrolijke en ongewone sfeer waar je kunt spelen met kunst en plezier kunt hebben met traditionele spellen van over de hele wereld","longdescr":"Op het programma: een tentoonstelling die is opgezet als een multicultureel Luna Park, creatieve workshops, speltoernooien, een openlucht escape game, concerten\r\n\r\nWeekend #1 (01.07 + 02.07) : traditionele spellen voorbij de grenzen \u00b7 escape game \u00b7 tentoonstelling \u00b7 workshops \r\n\r\nWeekend #2 (08\/07 + 09\/07) : video games \u00b7 escape game \u00b7 tentoonstelling \u00b7 workshops\r\n+ concert Duo Dram\u00e9-Bicaba (balafon \u00b7 percussie \u00b7 uit Burkina Faso) \r\n\r\nWeekend #3 (15\/07 + 16\/07) : moderne bordspellen \u00b7 escape game \u00b7 tentoonstelling \u00b7 workshops \r\n\r\nElke zaterdag (01\/07 + 08\/07 + 09\/07) van 14.30 uur tot 17.00 uur\r\nEscape game MATONGAME (gratis \u00b7 op inschrijving)\r\nMaximaal 15 deelnemers per sessie!\r\nReserveer uw plaats per e-mail naar medexmuseum@gmail.com\r\n\r\nAlle details op de evenementpagina: https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"en":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":"On the first three weekends of July, the MedexMuseum (Ephemeral Museum of Exile) invites you to a world games fair, an artistic journey that will transport you into a joyful and unusual atmosphere where you can play with art and have fun with traditional games from the four corners of the world.","longdescr":"On the programme: an exhibition designed as a multicultural Luna Park, creative workshops, games tournaments, an outdoor escape game, concerts...\r\n\r\nWeekend #1 (01.07 + 02.07): traditional games across borders - escape game - exhibition - workshops \r\n\r\nWeekend #2 (08\/07 + 09\/07): video games - escape game - exhibition - workshops \r\n+ concert by Duo Bram\u00e9 Bicama (balafon - percussion - from Burkina-Faso). \r\n\r\nWeekend #3 (15\/07 + 16\/07): modern board games - escape game - exhibition - workshops\r\n\r\nEvery Saturday (01\/07 + 08\/07 + 15\/07) from 2.30pm to 5pm \r\nEscape game MATONGE (free - registration required) \r\nMax 15 participants per session! \r\nBook your spot by email to medexmuseum@gmail.com\r\n\r\nFree participation \r\nThis event is supported by the commune of Ixelles as part of the Summer XL initiative. \r\n\r\nFull details on the event page: https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"de":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"it":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"sp":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"pt":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"},"cn":{"name":"Kermesse des jeux du monde \u00b7 SUMMER XL","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1a8vd6AKN","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559224"}},"place":{"id":265418,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Medex (Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Rue Longue Vie","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Longue Vie, 34A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Un mus\u00e9e qui n\u2019en est pas un, un mus\u00e9e valise qui porte une vision de la culture dans diff\u00e9rents endroits le temps d\u2019une exposition, d\u2019une performance ou d\u2019un \u00e9v\u00e9nement. \r\n\r\nLe Medex est un mus\u00e9e itin\u00e9rant, en d\u00e9placement, fait pour porter l'attention sur la th\u00e9matique de la migration et ses enjeux. Il est bas\u00e9 actuellement dans un ancien CARWASH \u00e0 Ixelles dans le quartier Matong\u00e9.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Medex (Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Lang-Levenstraat","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Lang-Levenstraat, 34A","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Het Medex  bevindt zich pal in de Matongewijk. Je ontdekt er alles over migratie en de uitdagingen die ermee gepaard gaan. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Medex (Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Rue Longue Vie","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Longue Vie, 34A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Located in the heart of Matong\u00e9, the Medex (Ephemeral Museum of Exile) explores every facet of migration and its challenges. The museum takes its visitors on a journey to a new country every month, through a varied cultural programme.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Medex (mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Rue Longue Vie","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_