te la reconnaissance du public comme de la critique. Suivent ensuite les aventures de Lulu et Nelson, un r\u00e9cit \u00e9crit par Charlotte Girard et Jean-Marie Omont. Avec un style dynamique et color\u00e9, la dessinatrice met en sc\u00e8ne de jeunes h\u00e9ros attachants en qu\u00eate d\u2019eux m\u00eame et de libert\u00e9. Un univers sensible et original que l\u2019exposition propose d\u2019explorer pour en d\u00e9couvrir toute la profondeur et la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9.","performers":"Aur\u00e9lie Neyret (autrice)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cbbd.be\/fr\/expositions\/les-grandes-expositions-temporaires\/cerise-lulu-et-nelson","email":"visit@cbbd.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 219 19 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537358"},"nl":{"name":"Cerise, Lulu en Nelson, de wereld van de kindertijd volgens Aur\u00e9lie Neyret","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De Franse illustratrice en stripauteur Aur\u00e9lie Neyret heeft van de kinderwereld haar creatieve universum gemaakt. Nadat ze talrijke illustraties tekende voor jeugdboeken en collectieve uitgaven, debuteert ze in de stripwereld aan de zijde van Joris Chamblain met de reeks Het dagboek van Cerise, waarmee ze zowel bij het publiek al bij critici het succes en erkenning oogst. Daarna volgen de avonturen van Lulu en Nelson, naar een verhaal van Charlotte Girard en Jean-Marie Omont. In een dynamische en kleurrijke stijl presenteert de illustratrice aandoenlijke jonge helden die op zoek zijn naar zichzelf en naar vrijheid. Een gevoelig en origineel universum dat de tentoonstelling in al zijn diepte en creativiteit wil doen ontdekken.","performers":"Aur\u00e9lie Neyret (auteur)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be\/nl\/tentoonstellingen\/tijdelijke-tentoonstellingen\/cerise-lulu-en-nelson","email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 219 19 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537358"},"en":{"name":"Cerise, Lulu and Nelson, the world of childhood by Aur\u00e9lie Neyret","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The French illustrator and cartoonist Aur\u00e9lie Neyret has made of the world of childhood her creative universe. After numerous illustrated books and collective publications, she made her debut in comics alongside Joris Chamblain with the series Les Carnets de Cerise, the success of which brought her recognition from the public as well as from critics. This was followed by the adventures of Lulu and Nelson, a story written by Charlotte Girard and Jean-Marie Omont. With a dynamic and colourful style, the illustrator presents endearing young heroes in search of themselves and of freedom. A sensitive and original universe that the exhibition proposes to explore and discover all its depth and creativity.","performers":"Aur\u00e9lie Neyret (author)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/exhibitions\/the-great-temporary-exhibitions\/cerise-lulu-and-nelson","email":"visit@comicscenter.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 219 19 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537358"},"de":{"name":"Cerise, Lulu et Nelson, les mondes de l'enfance d'Aur\u00e9lie Neyret","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cbbd.be\/fr\/expositions\/les-grandes-expositions-temporaires\/cerise-lulu-et-nelson","email":"visit@cbbd.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 219 19 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537358"},"it":{"name":"Cerise, Lulu et Nelson, les mondes de l'enfance d'Aur\u00e9lie Neyret","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cbbd.be\/fr\/expositions\/les-grandes-expositions-temporaires\/cerise-lulu-et-nelson","email":"visit@cbbd.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 219 