"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_content":{"list":[428],"values":["brussels-renaissance-festival"]},"tags":["exterior"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T03:35:25+02:00","published_at":"2023-04-01T20:26:41+02:00","backoffice_id":274665,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.32548726473767},{"id":560177,"date_start":"2023-07-01","date_end":"2023-07-30","date_next":"2023-07-08","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen","it":"Animazioni","sp":"Animaciones","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Waouw ! des coffres \u00e0 surprise(s)","shortdescr":"Tu veux explorer ? Deviner ? Retrouver ? Cr\u00e9er ? Rigoler ? Raconter ? Empare-toi des coffres Waouw !","longdescr":"\u00c0 l\u2019accueil, tu re\u00e7ois un trousseau de cl\u00e9s qui ouvre des coffres contenant chacun des activit\u00e9s vari\u00e9es permettant de d\u00e9couvrir un aspect du palais du Coudenberg : sa construction, son histoire, la collection d\u2019objets arch\u00e9ologiques, le m\u00e9tier d\u2019arch\u00e9ologue\u2026 Les jeux, qui se jouent seuls ou \u00e0 plusieurs, te permettront de d\u00e9couvrir de mani\u00e8re amusante l\u2019ancien palais de Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nInfos pratiques\r\nHoraires : vacances d'\u00e9t\u00e9, 1 au 31 juillet - de mercredi \u00e0 samedi.\r\nDestin\u00e9 aux familles et groupes avec enfants de 4 \u00e0 12 ans, en pr\u00e9sence d\u2019un adulte minimum (6 enfants maximum par famille ou groupe).\r\nActivit\u00e9 en autonomie, sans animateur du Coudenberg.\r\nTarif activit\u00e9: 4 \u20ac par enfant  (+ adulte 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac).\r\nR\u00e9servation recommand\u00e9e sur le webshop du mus\u00e9e BELvue.\r\nDur\u00e9e : 1 h - 1 h 30\r\nLangues : fran\u00e7ais, n\u00e9erlandais, anglais","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"nl":{"name":"WAOUW! Verrassingskoffers om iets te leren en plezier te maken","shortdescr":"Zin om te ontdekken? Te raden? Dingen te maken? Te lachen? Te vertellen? Ga op zoek naar de WAOUW koffers!","longdescr":"Aan het onthaal krijg je een sleutelbos waarmee je koffers, verspreid in de site, kan openen. Elke koffer bevat materiaal waarmee een bepaald aspect van het Coudenbergpaleis ontdekt kan worden: het gebouw, de geschiedenis ervan, de collectie archeologische voorwerpen, het beroep van archeoloog \u2026 Met de spelletjes, die je alleen of met meerdere kan spelen, kun je op een leuke manier de overblijfselen van het paleis van Brussel ontdekken.\r\n\r\nPraktische informatie\r\nWanneer: zomervakantie,  van 1 tot 31 juli 2023. Van woensdag tot zaterdag.\r\nGeschikt voor gezinnen en groepen met kinderen van 4 tot 12 jaar, met minstens 1 volwassene (maximum 6 kinderen per familie of groep).\r\nTarief voor de activiteit: \u20ac 4 \/ kind (+ volwassene \u20ac 10, senior \u20ac 8)\r\nReservatie online aanbevolen (webshop van het BELvue museum)\r\nDuur: 1u-1u30\r\nTalen: Nederlands, Frans, Engels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"en":{"name":"WAOUW! Treasure chests to enjoy and learn from","shortdescr":"You\u2019d like to explore? Guess? Find? Create? Laugh? Tell tales? Just get into the Waouw Chests!","longdescr":"On arrival, you receive a bunch of keys; these open a number of chests containing a variety of activities to enjoy and discover some aspects of Coudenberg Palace: what it looked like, how it grew, its history, our collection of archaeological objects, archaeology itself\u2026 Games may be for one or several people and will help you to enjoy exploring the former Brussels\u2019 Palace.\r\n\r\nPractical information\r\nWhen: Summer holidays, from 1 to 31 of July. From Wednesday to Saturday.\r\nSuitable for families with kids: ages 4-12, with at least 1 adult. (Max. 6 children per group \/ family)\r\nActivity without educator from Coudenberg Palace\r\nActivity cost: \u20ac4 \/ child (+ \u20ac10 Adult, \u20ac8 Senior)\r\nReservation recommended (soon on the BELvue Museum webshop). Call: + 32 (0)2 500 45 54 in case of problem\r\nDuration: 1h - 1h30\r\nLanguages: English, French, Dutch","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"de":{"name":"Waouw ! des coffres \u00e0 surprise(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"it":{"name":"Waouw ! des coffres \u00e0 surprise(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"sp":{"name":"Waouw ! des coffres \u00e0 surprise(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"pt":{"name":"Waouw ! des coffres \u00e0 surprise(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"},"cn":{"name":"Waouw ! des coffres \u00e0 surprise(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560177"}},"place":{"id":227859,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n\r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. \r\n\r\nPlongez dans l'histoire prestigieuse de Bruxelles et de son palais !\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. \r\n\r\nVele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt. \r\n\r\nLaat je onderdompelen in de prestigieuze geschiedenis van Brussel en zijn paleis!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire. Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archaeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n\r\nDuring a visit, explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground. \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the prestigious history of Brussels and its palace!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Con un' impressionante esposizione, questo sito archeologico rivela i resti del palazzo  dei duchi di Burgundye l'Aula Magna di Carlo V, oltre ad edifici e strade che ormai si trovano sotto il livello del suolo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"addre