opese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. \r\n\r\nVele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt. \r\n\r\nLaat je onderdompelen in de prestigieuze geschiedenis van Brussel en zijn paleis!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire. Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archaeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n\r\nDuring a visit, explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground. \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the prestigious history of Brussels and its palace!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Con un' impressionante esposizione, questo sito archeologico rivela i resti del palazzo  dei duchi di Burgundye l'Aula Magna di Carlo V, oltre ad edifici e strade che ormai si trovano sotto il livello del suolo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","boo