anslations":{"fr":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":"8 offices, 8 transformations","longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s avoir parcouru la Belgique pour pr\u00e9senter leur travail, les huit jeunes bureaux d\u2019architectes Bauclub, Every Island, Laboratoire, Linto Architecture, Pashenko Works, Sophia Holst, Studio Ruben Castro et Wissel Architectuur Studio posent leurs valises cet \u00e9t\u00e9 au MAD \u00e0 Bruxelles \u00e0 l\u2019occasion d\u2019une exposition collective.\r\n\r\nCes jeunes bureaux pr\u00e9senteront leur pratique architecturale en r\u00e9pondant \u00e0 la th\u00e9matique commune qu\u2019est la transformation en architecture au moyen d\u2019un projet, repr\u00e9sent\u00e9 en maquettes, dessins ou encore photographies.\r\n\r\nLe vernissage de l\u2019exposition aura lieu le 15 juin prochain \u00e0 partir de 18h et d\u00e9butera par une conf\u00e9rence lors de laquelle les huit bureaux, venant des quatre coins de la Belgique, pr\u00e9senteront leur travail, accompagn\u00e9.e.s par J\u00f6rn Aram Bihain (V+ architecture).\r\n\r\nAcross on Tour est une initiative d\u2019A+ Architecture in Belgium, r\u00e9alis\u00e9e en co-production avec le MAD Brussels, l\u2019Institut Culturel d\u2019Architecture Wallonie Bruxelles (ICA) et le Vlaams Architectuurinstituut (VAi).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"nl":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":"8 offices, 8 transformations","longdescr":"Na een tournee door Belgi\u00eb om hun werk te presenteren, installeren de acht jonge architectenbureaus Bauclub, Every Island, Laboratoire, Linto Architecture, Pashenko Works, Sophia Holst, Studio Ruben Castro en Wissel Architectuur Studio zich deze zomer in het MAD in Brussel voor een groepstentoonstelling.\r\n\r\nDeze jonge bureaus stellen hun architectuurpraktijk voor in reactie op het gemeenschappelijk thema Transformatie aan de hand van \u00e9\u00e9n project, weergegeven in maquettes, tekeningen en foto\u2019s.\r\n\r\nDe opening van de tentoonstelling vindt plaats op 15 juni om 18.00 uur en begint met een lezing waarbij de acht bureaus, afkomstig uit alle hoeken van Belgi\u00eb, hun architectuurpraktijk voorstellen, na een inleiding door J\u00f6rn Aram Bihain (V+ architecture).\r\n\r\nAcross on Tour is een initiatief van A+ Architecture in Belgium, in coproductie met het MAD Brussels, het Institut Culturel d\u2019Architecture Wallonie Bruxelles (ICA) en het Vlaams Architectuurinstituut (VAi).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"en":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":"8 offices, 8 transformations","longdescr":"After having travelled around Belgium to present their work, the eight young architectural firms Bauclub, Every Island, Laboratoire, Linto Architecture, Pashenko Works, Sophia Holst, Studio Ruben Castro and Wissel Architectuur Studio are settling down this summer at the MAD in Brussels for a collective exhibition.\r\n\r\nThese young offices will present their architectural practice by responding to the common theme of transformation in architecture through a project, represented in models, drawings or photographs.\r\n\r\nThe opening of the exhibition will take place on June 15th at 6pm and will start with a conference during which the eight offices, coming from all over Belgium, will present their work, accompanied by J\u00f6rn Aram Bihain (V+ architecture).\r\n\r\nAcross on Tour is an initiative of A+ Architecture in Belgium, realized in co-production with MAD Brussels, the Institut Culturel d'Architecture Wallonie Bruxelles (ICA) and the Vlaams Architectuurinstituut (VAi).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"de":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"it":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"sp":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"pt":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"},"cn":{"name":"Across on Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/across-tour","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560304"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":["Centro"],"sp":["Centro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.85116098,"lon":4.34417688},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T03:05:23+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:34:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,