"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Steenweg op Gent","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Zoals de naam al doet vermoeden, wil Bazaar Trottoir de stad laten zien vanuit haar meest geliefde gezichtspunt: de trottoirs. Een ankerpunt als een rode draad die zich ontvouwt via merk- en priv\u00e9wandelingen per thema (girl power, duurzaam Brussel, street art, zelfs \"singles only\"-wandelingen) of per buurt. Een ruime keuze die niet noodzakelijk op elk moment beschikbaar is. Aarzel niet om de agenda te raadplegen om meer te weten te komen over de volgende themawandelingen. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"As its name suggests, Bazaar Trottoir aims to show the city from its most popular point of view: its pavements. An anchor point like a red thread that unfolds through branded and private walks by theme (girl power, sustainable Brussels, street art, even \"singles only\" walks) or by neighbourhood. A wide range of choices not necessarily available at all times. Don't hesitate to check the agenda available in Dutch to find out about the next themed walks. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null