- 18 jaar"],"en":["Secondary school","14 - 16 years","16 - 18 years"],"de":["Sekundarstufe","14 - 16 Jahre","16 - 18 Jahre"],"it":["Medie","14 - 16 anni","16 - 18 anni"],"sp":["Estudiantes de secundaria","14 - 16 a\u00f1os","16 - 18 a\u00f1os"],"pt":[null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe"],"it":["Accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti"],"sp":["Habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T02:09:26+02:00","published_at":"2021-03-04T10:28:03+01:00","backoffice_id":229491,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.082778184256805},{"id":557208,"date_start":"2023-07-03","date_end":"2023-08-31","date_next":"2023-07-10","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"fr":"Divers","nl":"Varia","en":"Various","de":"Verschiedenes","it":"Varie","sp":"Varios","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[88],"translations":{"fr":["Jeux et quiz"],"nl":["Spel en quiz"],"en":["Games and quiz"],"de":["Spiele & Quiz"],"it":["Giochi e quiz"],"sp":["Juegos y concursos"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Les myst\u00e9rieuses aventures de L\u00e9o et Lily","shortdescr":"Cet \u00e9t\u00e9, le mus\u00e9e se transforme en un Bois sauvage magique, o\u00f9 les lutins L\u00e9o et Lily partent \u00e0 la recherche des pierres pr\u00e9cieuses vol\u00e9es. Rejoindrez-vous le duo de courageux lutins \u202f?\u202f","longdescr":"Cet \u00e9t\u00e9, le mus\u00e9e se transforme en un Bois sauvage magique, o\u00f9 les lutins L\u00e9o et Lily partent \u00e0 la recherche des pierres pr\u00e9cieuses vol\u00e9es. Rejoindrez-vous le duo de courageux lutins \u202f?\u202f \r\n\r\nExplorez le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019aide de livrets d\u2019activit\u00e9s ludiques adapt\u00e9s \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2ge de votre enfant. Il existe deux niveaux de jeu\u202f: de 4 \u00e0 6 ans et de 7 \u00e0 12 ans. Les carnets sont disponibles en fran\u00e7ais et en n\u00e9erlandais. Le jeu se fait en compagnie des parents (ou d\u2019autres accompagnants) et constitue une sortie agr\u00e9able pour toute la famille.\u202f \r\n\r\n\u202f \r\n\r\nQUAND\u202f: Du 3 juillet au 31 ao\u00fbt, du lundi au vendredi, de 9h00 \u00e0 17h00. Le mus\u00e9e sera ferm\u00e9 le 21 juillet et le 15 ao\u00fbt.\u202f\u202f \r\n\r\nPOUR QUI : Tous les aventuriers de 4 \u00e0 12 ans sont les bienvenus pour rejoindre les lutins dans leur qu\u00eate.\u202f\u202f \r\n\r\nDUREE : L\u2019aventure au mus\u00e9e dure entre 45 minutes et 1 heure. Il n\u2019est pas n\u00e9cessaire de r\u00e9server.\u202f\u202f \r\n\r\nPRIX\u202f: L\u00e9o et Lily ont besoin de l\u2019aide de tout le monde. L\u2019activit\u00e9 est totalement GRATUITE pour toute la famille\u202f!\u202f","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"nl":{"name":"Het grote avontuur van Leo en Lily","shortdescr":"Deze zomer wordt het museum omgetoverd tot het magische Wildewoud, waar kabouters Leo en Lily op zoek gaan naar de gestolen edelstenen. Ga jij mee op avontuur met het moedige kabouterduo?","longdescr":"Deze zomer wordt het museum omgetoverd tot het magische Wildewoud, waar kabouters Leo en Lily op zoek gaan naar de gestolen edelstenen. Ga jij mee op avontuur met het moedige kabouterduo? \r\n\r\n\r\nVerken het museum aan de hand van speelse doe-boekjes op maat van de leeftijd van jouw kind. Er zijn twee spelniveaus: 4-6 jaar en 7-12 jaar. De boekjes zijn zowel in het Frans als in het Nederlands te verkrijgen. Het spel wordt begeleid door de ouders (of andere begeleiders) en is een fijne uitstap voor het hele gezin.\u202f \r\n\r\n \r\nWANNEER: Het kabouterspel kan gespeeld worden van maandag 3 juli tot en met donderdag 31 augustus, elke weekdag van 9u tot 17u. Let op! Op 21 juli en 15 augustus sluiten we onze deuren tijdens de zomervakantie.\u202f \r\n\r\n \r\nVOOR WIE: Alle avonturiers van 4 tot 12 jaar zijn welkom om mee op tocht te gaan met de kabouters.\u202f\u202f \r\n\r\n\u202f \r\nDUUR: Het avontuur in het museum duurt ongeveer 45 minuten tot 1 uur. Reserveren is niet nodig.\u202f \r\n\r\n\r\nPRIJS: Leo en Lily verwelkomen alle helpende handen. Onze activiteit is volledig GRATIS voor het hele gezin!\u202f\u202f","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"en":{"name":"Les myst\u00e9rieuses aventures de L\u00e9o et Lily","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"de":{"name":"Schatten van Vlieg + Museum van de Nationale Bank","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"it":{"name":"Schatten van Vlieg + Museum van de Nationale Bank","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"sp":{"name":"Schatten van Vlieg + Museum van de Nationale Bank","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"pt":{"name":"Schatten van Vlieg + Museum van de Nationale Bank","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"},"cn":{"name":"Schatten van Vlieg + Museum van de Nationale Bank","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557208"}},"place":{"id":220155,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 2018, le mus\u00e9e de la Banque nationale de Belgique est install\u00e9 dans un magnifique b\u00e2timent bancaire datant du XIXe si\u00e8cle. \r\n\r\nUn premier circuit dans le mus\u00e9e aborde les r\u00f4les d\u2019une banque centrale \u00e0 travers une sc\u00e9nographie interactive. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son audioguide, le visiteur peut ainsi tant\u00f4t en apprendre un peu plus sur l\u2019\u00e9mission des pi\u00e8ces et des billets, tant\u00f4t tester ses connaissances sur l\u2019euro ou encore \u00eatre amen\u00e9 \u00e0 contr\u00f4ler le niveau d\u2019inflation. \r\n\r\nLe second circuit retrace l\u2019\u00e9volution des moyens de payement et fait la part belle aux collections historiques du mus\u00e9e. Monnaies marchandises, anciens objets de change, anciennes pi\u00e8ces et billets se c\u00f4toient ainsi dans une fresque th\u00e9matique et chronologique qui fera voyager le visiteur dans le temps et \u00e0 travers le monde.\r\n\r\nEnfin, le dernier circuit regroupe une s\u00e9rie d\u2019objets qui d\u00e9montre \u00e0 quel point l\u2019argent est pr\u00e9sent dans notre quotidien.\r\n\r\nLes visites de groupe sont organis\u00e9es \u00e0 partir de 10 personnes - maximum 25. Elles sont gratuites et durent environ 1 heure. Les r\u00e9servations se font via le formulaire en ligne disponible sur le site internet http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/fr\/booking. \r\nRenseignements : 02 221 22 06 \u2013 museum@nbb.be","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Warmoesberg","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Warmoesberg, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 2018 is het museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb in een prachtig 19de-eeuwse bankgebouw ondergebracht.\r\n\r\nAan de hand van interactieve opstellingen focust een eerste parcours in het museum op de taken van een centrale bank. Met behulp van een audiogids kan de bezoeker meer te weten komen over de uitgifte van munten en biljetten, zijn of haar kennis van de euro testen of proberen de inflatie onder controle te houden.\r\nHet tweede parcours schetst de evolutie van de betaalmiddelen en zet hierbij de collecties van het museum in de kijker. Goederengeld, oude ruilmiddelen, munten en biljetten vormen een thematisch en chronologisch geheel, waarbij de bezoeker wordt meegenomen op een reis in de tijd en over heel de wereld.\r\nHet derde parcours tenslotte toont een aantal voorwerpen waarmee wordt aangetoond hoe sterk geld aanwezig is in ons dagelijkse leven.\r\n\r\nGroepsbezoeken kunnen vanaf 10 personen, maximum 25. Ze zijn gratis en duren ongeveer 1 uur. Reserveren graag via de website van het museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl\/booking.\r\nMeer informatie: tel 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Museum of the National Bank of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since 2018 the museum of the National Bank of Belgium is housed in a splendid 19t century bank building situates at a mere 10-minute walk from the Central Station.\r\n\r\nThe first part of the exhibition pays particular attention to the role and the functions of the National Bank. By use of an audio guide and interactive displays, the visitor will no doubt discover lots of interesting facts about the issue of notes and coins, test their knowledge of the euro, or even try to control the rate of inflation.\r\n\r\nThe second part paints an overall picture of the evolution of money, and showcases many wonderful objects from the museum collection. Commodity money, diverse and peculiar objects once used for bartering, coins and notes... These many various pieces are purposely put in a thematical and chronological context which in the end will provide the visitor with a fascinating overview.\r\n\r\nThe third part of the exhibition proves just how much money is present in our day to day life by displaying a wide range of objects, some everyday and trivial, some quirky.\r\n\r\nGroup visits can be from 10 people up to 25. They are free and take about 1 hour. Please book via the website of the museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/en\/booking.\r\nMore information: 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"