ein staan de Brussel Danst Dance Battles voor de tweede keer op rij in de Grote Zaal van AB! Op 11 juli nemen de strafste (inter)nationale dansers het tegen elkaar op in 2 vs 2 dance battles met categorie\u00ebn hiphop, house, krump en ksaara. Een professionele jury kiest welk jong dansgeweld zich tot winnaar mag kronen. Lokale DJ's voorzien de beats die ook jouw beste dance moves naar boven zullen halen. Verwacht je aan spectaculaire moves en vurige duels!\n\nWanna battle? Schrijf je hier in: www.abconcerts.be\/nl\/agenda\/brussel-danst-dance-battles\/a105J000008G46VQAS\n\nEen coproductie van Ancienne Belgique, TIMISS, Muntpunt, Beursschouwburg, Krump Belgium en Ch'eza\n\nOntdek het volledige programma op brusseldanst.be","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559472"},"en":{"name":"Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559472"},"de":{"name":"Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559472"},"it":{"name":"Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559472"},"sp":{"name":"Brussel Danst Dance Battles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail