eenstemming met de actualiteit van de muziekscene hier en elders komen alle stijlen aan bod,  met toch een duidelijk overwicht aan rock en pop. De concertruimtes omvatten de  modulaire Grote Zaal met tribune en balkons, de AB-Box en de Club, die bijna elke avond daveren op hun grondvesten, zowel letterlijk als figuurlijk.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Ancienne Belgique has been a special place for live performances since 1979. The AB presents contemporary music, especially rock and pop, from all over the world. Besides concerts with internationally famous artists, the AB offers young musicians three stages where they can perform.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Seit 1970 ist das Ancienne Belgique, AB f\u00fcr Kenner und Freunde, einer der hochkar\u00e4tigsten Konzerts\u00e4le Br\u00fcssels. Mit einer Vorliebe f\u00fcr Rock und Pop finden hier regelm\u00e4\u00dfig rauschende Live-Konzerte statt. In den Konzerts\u00e4le - vom gro\u00dfen Saal mit R\u00e4ngen \u00fcber die AB-Box bis hin zum Club - heizen die gastierenden Gruppen dem Publikum fast t\u00e4glich ein.