il.560049"},"nl":{"name":"Art Nouveau Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Fiets mee langs de Maelbeekvallei en ontdek de diversiteit van het art nouveau-erfgoed in het avondlicht. Deze gegidste tour leidt je doorheen de mooiste wijken van Schaarbeek, de wijk van de Squares, de vijvers van Elsene en Brussel-Stad. Onderweg maak je kennis met een diverse selectie aan architectuurparels van de Art nouveau: priv\u00e9 -en opbrengsthuizen, scholen, hotels, winkels en zelfs een beeldhouwwerk in de openbare ruimte.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"},"en":{"name":"Art Nouveau - Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"},"de":{"name":"Art Nouveau - Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"},"it":{"name":"Art Nouveau - Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"},"sp":{"name":"Art Nouveau - Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"},"pt":{"name":"Art Nouveau - Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"},"cn":{"name":"Art Nouveau - Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560049"}},"place":{"id":250146,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D6","email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7\/D6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cactus Bruxelles \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est une association bruxelloise de guides b\u00e9n\u00e9voles locaux ayant \u00e0 coeur Bruxelles et le v\u00e9lo.\r\nIls partagent avec enthousiasme leur passion pour la ville et le v\u00e9lo avec les visiteurs de la ville et les autres Bruxellois. Ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience et une introduction authentique \u00e0 Bruxelles. A v\u00e9lo ils trouvent le rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et sa diversit\u00e9.\r\nAvant tout, ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent vous guider le long des chemins les moins battus de Bruxelles et cela dans une ambiance conviviale. D\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles pleinement et d\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne le pensez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo !\r\nZaterdagtour","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","add