icult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-07-08T02:35:36+02:00","published_at":"2023-06-16T11:22:57+02:00","backoffice_id":279748,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.16797288504298},{"id":552502,"date_start":"2023-04-01","date_end":"2023-09-02","date_next":"2023-08-05","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[113],"translations":{"fr":["Histoire Industrielle"],"nl":["Industri\u00eble geschiedenis"],"en":["Industrial History"],"de":["Industrielle Geschichte"],"it":["Storia industriale"],"sp":["Historia industrial"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Brussels Beer: A Travel through Time","shortdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir ce que 100 ans d'\u00e9volution technologique change \u00e0 la bi\u00e8re et son go\u00fbt!","longdescr":"Nous sommes en Belgique assez fiers de notre h\u00e9ritage brassicole, et bien s\u00fbr Bruxelles ne fait pas exception.\r\nEt nous avons de magnifiques vestiges et autre traces de ce pass\u00e9 florissant, qui ne demandent qu'\u00e0 \u00eatre racont\u00e9s, montr\u00e9s, partag\u00e9s.\r\n\r\nMais que savons-nous au juste de ce que Bruxelles-la-brassicole a \u00e0 offrir?\r\nQuelles sont les influences du temps sur la technique de brassage, et nos go\u00fbts?\r\n\r\nPeut-on go\u00fbter la bi\u00e8re d'antan? Peut-on imaginer la bi\u00e8re du futur?\r\n\r\nRejoignez-nous pour un v\u00e9ritable voyage dans le temps, et venez go\u00fbter avec nous ce que Bruxelles a de mieux \u00e0 vous offrir en termes de bi\u00e8res, de culture, de go\u00fbt.\r\nVisite uniquement destin\u00e9e aux curieux de la bi\u00e8re... et \u00e0 ceux qui ne l'aiment pas!\r\n\r\nTous les premiers samedis du mois!\r\n\r\nPoint de ralliement: Porte d'entr\u00e9e de la Brasserie Cantillon, Rue Gheude 56, 1070 Bruxelles, fin de la visite \u00e0 la Nanobrasserie de l'Ermitage, Rue Lambert Crick 2, 1070 Bruxelles.\r\nVisite en anglais (par d\u00e9faut), fran\u00e7ais et italien sur demande.\r\nLa visite commence \u00e0 13h pr\u00e9cises, merci de vous pr\u00e9senter au moins 10 minutes avant le d\u00e9but de la visite.","performers":"La bi\u00e8re, chez Agalmalt, est prise non seulement comme un objet de plaisir, de savoir, Nous ne la brassons pas, nous ne la vendons pas, nous en sommes les entremetteurs.\r\n\r\nAgalmalt propose des visites guid\u00e9es, d\u00e9gustations, \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s, workshops et des services de consulting afin de promouvoir la bi\u00e8re artisanale.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Beer: A Travel through Time","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Beer: A Travel through Time","shortdescr":"Experience what 100 years of technological evolution does to beer!","longdescr":"In Belgium we\u2019re pretty proud of our beer legacy, and Brussels makes no exception to it. We have a flourishing past with testimonies and stories here and there, awaiting to be told.\r\n\r\nBut do we know precisely what does Brussels have to offer beer-wise ?\r\n\r\nHow does time influence brewing technique, our taste expectations ?\r\n\r\nCan we taste beer past ? Is it possible to imagine beer future ?\r\n\r\nJoin us for an exclusive time travel, and experience the evolution of brewing \u2013 and its major consequences \u2013 on-site in the core of Brussels beer culture. For beer sceptics and enthusiasts only, every first Saturday !\r\n\r\nMeeting point: Front Door of the Brasserie Cantillon, Rue Gheude 56, 1070 Bruxelles.\r\nTour held in English (default), French and Italian available upon request. Visit starts at 1pm Sharp, please make sure that you are there at least 10 min before the beginning.","performers":"At Agalmalt, beer is taken not only as an object of pleasure, but also of knowledge.\r\nWe are dedicated to the transmission of tools and knowledge so that our audiences can ultimately take an enlightened and autonomous stand by questioning commonplaces.\r\n\r\nAgalmalt Offers Tours, visits, tastings, private events, workshops and consulting services to promote craft beer.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"de":{"name":"A Travel through Time","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"it":{"name":"A Travel through Time","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"sp":{"name":"A Travel through Time","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"pt":{"name":"A Travel through Time","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"},"cn":{"name":"A Travel through Time","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com\/events","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552502"}},"place":{"id":235618,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Brasserie Cantillon - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de la Gueuze","address_street_name":"Rue Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Perdu dans un quartier moins touristique, le Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de la Gueuze pr\u00e9sente un patrimoine \"vivant\" car toujours en activit\u00e9, dans son contexte technique, \u00e9conomique et historique. D'octobre \u00e0 fin mars, \u00e0 la brasserie \"Cantillon\", on peut assister aux diverses \u00e9tapes de la fabrication de la gueuze et du lambic. Le public parcourra avec plaisir les diff\u00e9rentes salles : salle de brassage, salle des cuves de cuisson, greniers \u00e0 grains, bac refroidissoir, salle de futailles des tonneaux, lieu d'assemblage, lieu de nettoyage des f\u00fbts, bloc d'embouteillage et enfin, la cave.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Brouwerij Cantillon - Brussels Museum van de Geuze","address_street_name":"Gheudestraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Gheudestraat","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In een minder toeristische buurt stelt het Brussels Museum van de Geuze een \"levend\" erfgoed voor, in zijn technische, economische en historische context. Van oktober tot eind maart kan men in deze actieve brouwerij \"Cantillon\" in levende lijve de verschillende fasen van het brouwen van geuze en lambic meemaken. Aan de bezoekers worden de verschillende stadia uitgelegd aan de hand van de opeenvolgende ruimtes: de brouwerszaal, de zaal met de gistkuipen, de graanzolders, de koelbakken, de opslagplaats voor de houten vaten, de werkplaats voor het op fles trekken en natuurlijk de kelder voor het bewaren van de flessen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cantillon Brewery - Brussels Museum of the Gueuze","address_street_name":"R. Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"R. Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"This family brewery where Lambic, Gueuze, Faro and Kriek are made and where nothing has changed since 1900 when it was founded, welcomes you and invites you to discover a fabulous world. Beers, tools and brewing process are still the same as in the beginning. Red copper containers, barrels, some of them more than 100 years old, and walls of bottles constitute the scenery for your visit.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Brauerei Cantillon - Br\u00fcsseler Gueuze-Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Brauerei Cantillon - belgisches Bier mit Michelin-Stern! Die Brauerei Cantillon ist die einzige noch aktive Brauerei in Br\u00fcssel, die f\u00fcr die \u00d6ffentlichkeit zug\u00e4nglich ist. \r\nVerborgen in einem etwas weniger touristischen Viertel betreibt die Brauerei Cantillon seit 1978 auch das Br\u00fcsseler Gueuze-Museum, das die Besonderheiten der spontang\u00e4rigen belgischen Biere Gueze, Lambic und artverwandten Biere in Szene setzt.  \r\n\r\nVon Oktober bis Ende M\u00e4rz kann man den Braumeistern der Brauerei Cantillon bei ihrer Arbeit \u00fcber die Schulter blicken und die verschiedenen Etappen des Brauprozesses verfolgen: Vom Brausaal \u00fcber den Kesselsaal, den Kornspeicher, das K\u00fchlbecken, die unterschiedlichen Etappen der Bierf\u00e4sser, die Abf\u00fcllung und bis hin zum Keller.\r\n\r\nDie Brauerei, in der Braumeister Jean-Pierre van Roy die Familientradition fortsetzt, darf sich sogar mit einem Stern des Gourmetf\u00fchrers Michelin schm\u00fccken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Brasserie Cantillon - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de la Gueuze","address_street_name":"Rue Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Brasserie Cantillon - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de la Gueuze","address_street_name":"Rue Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/